#: config.py:42
msgid ""
"Are you using a regular Python console instead of a Friendly console?\n"
"If so, to continue, try: `start_console(local_vars=locals())`.\n"
"You will need to import `start_console` if you have not already done so.\n"
msgstr ""
"Friendly konsoli örniga oddiy Python konsolidan foydalanayapsizmi?\n"
"Agar şunday bölsa, davom etiş uçun `start_console(local_vars=locals())` ni sinab köring.\n"
"Agar hali import qilmagan bölsangiz, `start_console` ni import qilişingiz kerak böladi.\n"

