"If you are using the Friendly console, use `www()` to\n"
"do an Internet search for this particular case.\n"
msgstr ""
"Agar Friendly konsolidan foydalanayotgan bölsangiz, aynan şu holatni\n"
"internetdan qidiriş uçun `www()` dan foydalaning.\n"

#: ft_gettext.py:107
msgid "Internal error for Friendly.\n"
msgstr "Friendly içki xatosi.\n"

