msgstr "Friendly-traceback ni öçiradi va oldingi istisno işlovçisini tiklaydi."

#: functions_help.py:13
msgid "Enable friendly-traceback as an exception hook"
msgstr "Friendly-traceback ni istisno işlovçisi sifatida yoqadi"

#: functions_help.py:14
msgid "Shows all the information about the last traceback."
msgstr "Oxirgi traceback haqidagi barça maʼlumotlarni körsatadi."

#: functions_help.py:18
msgid "Sets the language to be used."
msgstr "Işlatiladigan tilni örnatadi."

#: functions_help.py:19
msgid "Shows the paths corresponding to synonyms used."
msgstr "Işlatilgan sinonimlarga mos yöllarni körsatadi."

#: functions_help.py:20
msgid "Shows the generic meaning of a given exception."
msgstr "Berilgan istisnoning umumiy maʼnosini körsatadi."

#: functions_help.py:21
msgid "Shows where an exception was raised."
msgstr "Istisno qayerda yuzaga kelganini körsatadi."

#: functions_help.py:22
msgid "Shows the likely cause of the exception."
msgstr "Istisnoning ehtimoliy sababini körsatadi."

#: functions_help.py:23
msgid "Opens a web browser at a useful location."
msgstr "Veb-brauzerni foydali sahifada oçadi."

#: functions_help.py:24
msgid "Suggestion sometimes added to a friendly traceback."
msgstr "Baʼzan friendly traceback ga qöşiladigan taklif."

#: functions_help.py:25
msgid "Shows a normal Python traceback."
msgstr "Oddiy Python traceback ni körsatadi."

#: functions_help.py:26
msgid "Shows a simplified Python traceback."
msgstr "Soddalaştirilgan Python traceback ni körsatadi."

#: functions_help.py:27
msgid "Returns the current value used for items to include by default."
msgstr "Standart böyiça körsatiladigan elementlar uçun joriy qiymatni qaytaradi."

#: functions_help.py:30
msgid "Sets the items to show by default when an exception is raised."
msgstr "Istisno yuzaga kelganda standart böyiça körsatiladigan elementlarni örnatadi."

#: functions_help.py:33
msgid "Returns the language currently used."
msgstr "Hozir işlatilayotgan tilni qaytaradi."

#: functions_help.py:34
msgid "Sets the formatter to use for display."
msgstr "Körsatiş uçun işlatiladigan formatlovçini örnatadi."

#: functions_help.py:35
msgid "Use True (default) or False to enable debugging methods."
msgstr "Debug metodlarini yoqiş uçun True (standart) yoki False dan foydalaning."

#: info_generic.py:43
msgid "A warning of type `{name}` is a subclass of `{parent}`.\n"
msgstr "`{name}` turidagi ogohlantiriş `{parent}` ning quyi klassi.\n"

#: info_generic.py:47
msgid "An exception of type `{name}` is a subclass of `{parent}`.\n"
msgstr "`{name}` turidagi istisno `{parent}` ning quyi klassi.\n"

#: info_generic.py:50
msgid "Nothing more specific is known about `{name}`."
msgstr "`{name}` haqida bundan aniqroq heç narsa maʼlum emas."

#: info_generic.py:54
msgid ""
"The inheritance is as follows:\n"
"\n"
"    {tree}\n"
msgstr ""
"Merosxörlik quyidagiça:\n"
"\n"
"    {tree}\n"

#: info_generic.py:97
msgid ""
"Most built-in exceptions defined by Python are derived from `Exception`.\n"
"All user-defined exceptions should also be derived from this class.\n"
msgstr ""
"Python tomonidan aniqlangan içki istisnolarning köpçiligi `Exception` dan hosil qilingan.\n"
"Foydalanuvçi aniqlagan barça istisnolar ham şu klassdan hosil qilinişi kerak.\n"

#: info_generic.py:105
msgid ""
"`BaseException` is the base class for all built-in exceptions.\n"
"It is not meant to be directly inherited by user-defined classes.\n"
msgstr ""
"`BaseException` — barça içki istisnolarning asosiy klassi.\n"
"U foydalanuvçi aniqlagan klasslar tomonidan bevosita meros olinişi uçun möljallanmagan.\n"

#: info_generic.py:113
msgid ""
"`ArithmeticError` is the base class for those built-in exceptions\n"
"that are raised for various arithmetic errors.\n"
msgstr ""
"`ArithmeticError` — turli arifmetik xatolarda yuzaga keladigan\n"
"içki istisnolarning asosiy klassi.\n"

#: info_generic.py:121
msgid ""
"In Python, the keyword `assert` is used in statements of the form\n"
"`assert condition`, to confirm that `condition` is not `False`,\n"
"nor equivalent to `False` such as an empty list, etc.\n"
"\n"
"If `condition` is `False` or equivalent, an `AssertionError` is raised.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pythonda `assert` kalit sözi `assert condition` körinişidagi operatorlarda\n"
"`condition` (şart) `False` emasligini, şuningdek, böş röyxat kabi\n"
"`False` ga teng kuçli emasligini tasdiqlaş uçun işlatiladi.\n"
"\n"
"Agar `condition` `False` yoki unga teng kuçli bölsa, `AssertionError` yuzaga keladi.\n"

#: info_generic.py:131
msgid ""
"An `AttributeError` occurs when the code contains something like\n"
"    `object.x`\n"
"and `x` is not a method or attribute (variable) belonging to `object`.\n"
msgstr ""
"`AttributeError` kodda quyidagiga öxşaş narsa bölganda yuz beradi:\n"
"    `object.x`\n"
"va `x` `object` ga tegişli metod yoki atribut (özgaruvçi) bölmasa.\n"

#: info_generic.py:140
msgid ""
"An `EOFError` is raised when the `input()` function hits\n"
"an end-of-file condition (EOF) without reading any data.\n"
msgstr ""
"`EOFError` `input()` funksiyasi heç qanday maʼlumot öqimasdan\n"
"fayl oxiriga (EOF) duç kelganda yuzaga keladi.\n"

#: info_generic.py:148
msgid ""
"A `FileNotFoundError` exception indicates that you\n"
"are trying to open a file that cannot be found by Python.\n"
"This could be because you misspelled the name of the file.\n"
msgstr ""
"`FileNotFoundError` istisnosi siz Python topa olmaydigan\n"
"faylni oçişga urinayotganingizni bildiradi.\n"
"Bu fayl nomini xato yozganingiz sababli bölişi mumkin.\n"

#: info_generic.py:157
msgid ""
"An `ImportError` exception indicates that a certain object could not\n"
"be imported from a module or package. Most often, this is\n"
"because the name of the object is not spelled correctly.\n"
msgstr ""
"`ImportError` istisnosi modul yoki paketdan maʼlum bir obyektni\n"
"import qilib bölmaganini bildiradi. Köpinça buning sababi\n"
"obyekt nomi notöğri yozilgani böladi.\n"

#: info_generic.py:166
msgid ""
"An `IndentationError` occurs when a given line of code is\n"
"not indented (aligned vertically with other lines) as expected.\n"
msgstr ""
"`IndentationError` biror kod qatori kutilganidek\n"
"çekiniş bilan yozilmaganda (boşqa qatorlar bilan vertikal tekislanmaganda) yuz beradi.\n"

#: info_generic.py:174
msgid ""
"An `IndexError` occurs when you try to get an item from a list,\n"
"a tuple, or a similar object (sequence), and use an index which\n"
"does not exist; typically, this happens because the index you give\n"
"is greater than the length of the sequence.\n"
msgstr ""
"`IndexError` röyxat, kortej yoki şunga öxşaş obyektdan (ketma-ketlikdan)\n"
"element olişga urinib, mavjud bölmagan indeksdan foydalanganingizda\n"
"yuz beradi; odatda bu siz bergan indeks ketma-ketlik uzunligidan\n"
"katta bölgani uçun sodir böladi.\n"

#: info_generic.py:184
msgid ""
"A `KeyError` is raised when a value is not found as a\n"
"key in a Python dict or in a similar object.\n"
msgstr ""
"`KeyError` qiymat Python luğatida (dict) yoki şunga öxşaş obyektda\n"
"kalit sifatida topilmaganda yuzaga keladi.\n"

#: info_generic.py:192
msgid ""
"`LookupError` is the base class for the exceptions that are raised\n"
"when a key or index used on a mapping or sequence is invalid.\n"
"It can also be raised directly by codecs.lookup().\n"
msgstr ""
"`LookupError` — xaritalaş yoki ketma-ketlikda işlatilgan kalit yoki indeks\n"
"notöğri bölganda yuzaga keladigan istisnolarning asosiy klassi.\n"
"U codecs.lookup() tomonidan bevosita ham yuzaga keltirilişi mumkin.\n"

#: info_generic.py:201
msgid ""
"Like the name indicates, a `MemoryError` occurs when Python\n"
"runs out of memory. This can happen if you create an object\n"
"that is too big, like a list with too many items.\n"
msgstr ""
"Nomidan körinib turganidek, `MemoryError` Pythonning xotirasi\n"
"tugaganda yuz beradi. Bu, masalan, juda köp elementli röyxat kabi\n"
"juda katta obyekt yaratsangiz sodir bölişi mumkin.\n"

#: info_generic.py:210
msgid ""
"A `ModuleNotFoundError` exception indicates that you\n"
"are trying to import a module that cannot be found by Python.\n"
"This could be because you misspelled the name of the module\n"
"or because it is not installed on your computer.\n"
msgstr ""
"`ModuleNotFoundError` istisnosi siz Python topa olmaydigan\n"
"modulni import qilişga urinayotganingizni bildiradi.\n"
"Bu modul nomini xato yozganingiz yoki u kompyuteringizda\n"
"örnatilmagani sababli bölişi mumkin.\n"

#: info_generic.py:220
msgid ""
"A `NameError` exception indicates that a variable or\n"
"function name is not known to Python.\n"
"Most often, this is because there is a spelling mistake.\n"
"However, sometimes it is because the name is used\n"
"before being defined or given a value.\n"
msgstr ""
"`NameError` istisnosi özgaruvçi yoki funksiya nomi\n"
"Pythonga nomaʼlum ekanini bildiradi.\n"
"Köpinça buning sababi imlo xatosi böladi.\n"
"Biroq baʼzan bu nom aniqlanişidan yoki\n"
"qiymat berilişidan oldin işlatilgani uçun sodir böladi.\n"

#: info_generic.py:231
msgid ""
"An `OSError` exception is usually raised by the Operating System\n"
"to indicate that an operation is not allowed or that\n"
"a resource is not available.\n"
msgstr ""
"`OSError` istisnosini odatda operatsion tizim\n"
"amalga ruxsat berilmaganini yoki biror resurs\n"
"mavjud emasligini bildiriş uçun yuzaga keltiradi.\n"

#: info_generic.py:240
msgid ""
"An `OverflowError` is raised when the result of an arithmetic operation\n"
"is too large to be handled by the computer's processor.\n"
msgstr ""
"`OverflowError` arifmetik amal natijasi kompyuter protsessori\n"
"qayta işlay olmaydigan darajada katta bölganda yuzaga keladi.\n"

#: info_generic.py:248
msgid ""
"A `RecursionError` is raised when a function calls itself,\n"
"directly or indirectly, too many times.\n"
"It almost always indicates that you made an error in your code\n"
"and that your program would never stop.\n"
msgstr ""
"`RecursionError` funksiya özini bevosita yoki bilvosita\n"
"juda köp marta çaqirganda yuzaga keladi.\n"
"Bu deyarli doim kodingizda xato borligini\n"
"va dasturingiz heç qaçon töxtamasligini bildiradi.\n"

#: info_generic.py:258
msgid ""
"A `RuntimeError` is raised when an error is detected that doesn't fall in any\n"
"of the more specific exception types defined by Python.\n"
msgstr ""
"`RuntimeError` Python aniqlagan aniqroq istisno turlarining heç biriga\n"
"tuşmaydigan xato aniqlanganda yuzaga keladi.\n"

#: info_generic.py:266
msgid ""
"`StopIteration` is raised to indicate that an iterator has no more\n"
"item to provide when its `__next__` method is called by\n"
"the `next()` builtin function.\n"
msgstr ""
"`StopIteration` iteratorning `__next__` metodi içki `next()` funksiyasi\n"
"tomonidan çaqirilganda, iteratorda boşqa beradigan element\n"
"qolmaganini bildiriş uçun yuzaga keladi.\n"

#: info_generic.py:275
msgid "A `SyntaxError` occurs when Python cannot understand your code.\n"
msgstr "`SyntaxError` Python kodingizni tuşuna olmaganda yuz beradi.\n"

#: info_generic.py:280
msgid ""
"A `TabError` indicates that you have used both spaces\n"
"and tab characters to indent your code.\n"
"This is not allowed in Python.\n"
"Indenting your code means to have block of codes aligned vertically\n"
"by inserting either spaces or tab characters at the beginning of lines.\n"
"Python's recommendation is to always use spaces to indent your code.\n"
msgstr ""
"`TabError` kodingizni çekiniş bilan yozişda ham böşliqlar,\n"
"ham tabulyatsiya belgilaridan foydalanganingizni bildiradi.\n"
"Pythonda bunga ruxsat berilmaydi.\n"
"Kodni çekiniş bilan yoziş — qatorlar boşiga böşliqlar yoki tabulyatsiya\n"
"belgilarini qöyib, kod bloklarini vertikal tekislaş demakdir.\n"
"Python kodni çekiniş bilan yozişda doim böşliqlardan foydalanişni tavsiya qiladi.\n"

#: info_generic.py:292
msgid ""
"A `TypeError` is usually caused by trying\n"
"to combine two incompatible types of objects,\n"
"by calling a function with the wrong type of object,\n"
"or by trying to do an operation not allowed on a given type of object.\n"
msgstr ""
"`TypeError` odatda ikki mos kelmaydigan turdagi obyektlarni\n"
"birlaştirişga urinişdan, funksiyani notöğri turdagi obyekt bilan\n"
"çaqirişdan yoki berilgan turdagi obyekt uçun ruxsat berilmagan\n"
"amalni bajarişga urinişdan kelib çiqadi.\n"

#: info_generic.py:302
msgid ""
"A `ValueError` indicates that a function or an operation\n"
"received an argument of the right type, but an inappropriate value.\n"
msgstr ""
"`ValueError` funksiya yoki amal töğri turdagi, lekin\n"
"nomaqbul qiymatga ega argument olganini bildiradi.\n"

#: info_generic.py:310
msgid ""
"In Python, variables that are used inside a function are known as \n"
"local variables. Before they are used, they must be assigned a value.\n"
"A variable that is used before it is assigned a value is assumed to\n"
"be defined outside that function; it is known as a `global`\n"
"(or sometimes `nonlocal`) variable. You cannot assign a value to such\n"
"a global variable inside a function without first indicating to\n"
"Python that this is a global variable, otherwise you will see\n"
"an `UnboundLocalError`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pythonda funksiya içida işlatiladigan özgaruvçilar\n"
"lokal özgaruvçilar deb ataladi. Ular işlatilişidan oldin ularga qiymat berilişi kerak.\n"
"Qiymat berilişidan oldin işlatilgan özgaruvçi şu funksiyadan\n"
"taşqarida aniqlangan deb hisoblanadi; u `global`\n"
"(yoki baʼzan `nonlocal`) özgaruvçi deb ataladi. Bunday global özgaruvçiga\n"
"funksiya içida, avval Pythonga uning global özgaruvçi ekanini\n"
"körsatmasdan qiymat bera olmaysiz, aks holda\n"
"`UnboundLocalError` ni körasiz.\n"

#: info_generic.py:324
msgid ""
"A `ZeroDivisionError` occurs when you are attempting to divide a value\n"
"by zero either directly or by using some other mathematical operation.\n"
msgstr ""
"`ZeroDivisionError` qiymatni bevosita yoki boşqa matematik amal\n"
"yordamida nolga bölişga urinayotganingizda yuz beradi.\n"

#: info_generic.py:332
msgid "`UserWarning` is the default class for `warnings.warn()`.\n"
msgstr "`UserWarning` — `warnings.warn()` uçun standart klass.\n"

#: info_generic.py:337
msgid "`SyntaxWarning` often indicates that your code will likely not give the result you expect.\n"
msgstr "`SyntaxWarning` köpinça kodingiz siz kutgan natijani bermasligi mumkinligini bildiradi.\n"

#: info_generic.py:344
msgid "`DeprecationWarning` indicates that some feature will not be available in a future version.\n"
msgstr "`DeprecationWarning` baʼzi imkoniyatlar kelajakdagi versiyada mavjud bölmasligini bildiradi.\n"

#: info_generic.py:351
msgid "`RuntimeWarning` often indicates some not recommended runtime features.\n"
msgstr "`RuntimeWarning` köpinça bajariliş paytidagi tavsiya etilmaydigan imkoniyatlarni bildiradi.\n"

#: info_generic.py:358
msgid ""
"`FutureWarning` is the base category for features that will likely be deprecated\n"
"in future Python versions.\n"
msgstr ""
"`FutureWarning` — kelajakdagi Python versiyalarida eskirgan deb eʼlon qilinişi\n"
"mumkin bölgan imkoniyatlar uçun asosiy kategoriya.\n"

#: info_generic.py:366
msgid "`UnicodeWarning` is the base category for warnings related to unicode.\n"
msgstr "`UnicodeWarning` — unicode bilan bağliq ogohlantirişlar uçun asosiy kategoriya.\n"

#: info_generic.py:371
msgid "`BytesWarning` is the base category for warnings related to bytes and bytearray.\n"
msgstr "`BytesWarning` — bytes va bytearray bilan bağliq ogohlantirişlar uçun asosiy kategoriya.\n"

#: info_generic.py:378
msgid "`Warning` is the base class of all warning category classes.\n"
msgstr "`Warning` — barça ogohlantiriş kategoriyalari klasslarining asosiy klassi.\n"

