#: runtime_errors\import_error.py:186
msgid ""
"The problem was likely caused by what is known as a 'circular import'.\n"
"First, Python imported and started executing the code in file\n"
"   '{file}'.\n"
"which imports module `{last_module}`.\n"
"During this process, the code in another file,\n"
"   '{last_file}'\n"
"was executed. However in this last file, an attempt was made\n"
"to import the original module `{last_module}`\n"
"a second time, before Python had completed the first import.\n"
msgstr ""
"Muammoga, ehtimol, \"aylanma import\" (circular import) deb ataladigan holat sabab bölgan.\n"
"Avval Python quyidagi fayldagi kodni import qilib, bajarişni boşladi:\n"
"   '{file}'.\n"
"U `{last_module}` modulini import qiladi.\n"
"Bu jarayon davomida boşqa fayldagi kod bajarildi:\n"
"   '{last_file}'\n"
"Biroq bu oxirgi faylda Python birinçi importni tugatişidan oldin\n"
"asl `{last_module}` modulini ikkinçi marta\n"
"import qilişga uriniş bölgan.\n"

