#: runtime_errors\os_error.py:38
msgid ""
"I suspect that you wrote a filename or path that contains\n"
"at least one backslash character, `\\`.\n"
"Python likely interpreted this as indicating the beginning of\n"
"what is known as an escape sequence.\n"
"To solve the problem, either write a so-called 'raw string'\n"
"by adding the letter `r` as a prefix in\n"
"front of the filename or path, or replace all single backslash\n"
"characters, `\\`, by double ones: `\\\\`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Menimça, siz kamida bitta teskari egri çiziq belgisi `\\` bölgan\n"
"fayl nomi yoki yölni yozgansiz.\n"
"Python, ehtimol, buni ekranlaş ketma-ketligi (escape sequence)\n"
"deb ataladigan narsaning boşlanişi deb tuşungan.\n"
"Muammoni hal qiliş uçun fayl nomi yoki yöl oldiga `r` harfini\n"
"qöşib, \"xom satr\" (raw string) yozing yoki barça yakka\n"
"teskari egri çiziq belgilarini `\\` qöştalari bilan almaştiring: `\\\\`.\n"

#: runtime_errors\runtime_error.py:48
msgid ""
"While you were iterating over the items of `{name}` ({container_type})\n"
"in a `{for_while}` loop, you either tried to add or remove items from it.\n"
"Suggestion: start by making a copy of `{name}` and iterate over the items\n"
"of that copy if you want to change `{name}` inside a loop.\n"
"You might want to do this as follows:\n"
"\n"
"    my_{name} = {name}.copy()\n"
"    for item in my_{name}:\n"
"        # Change {name}\n"
msgstr ""
"Siz `{for_while}` siklida `{name}` ({container_type}) elementlari\n"
"böyiça iteratsiya qilayotganingizda, unga element qöşiş yoki undan öçirişga urindingiz.\n"
"Taklif: agar sikl içida `{name}` ni özgartirmoqçi bölsangiz, avval `{name}` dan\n"
"nusxa oling va şu nusxaning elementlari böyiça iteratsiya qiling.\n"
"Buni quyidagiça qilişingiz mumkin:\n"
"\n"
"    my_{name} = {name}.copy()\n"
"    for item in my_{name}:\n"
"        # {name} ni özgartiring\n"

#: runtime_errors\runtime_error.py:59
msgid ""
"While you were iterating over the items of a container ({container_type})\n"
"in a `{for_while}` loop, you either tried to add or remove items from it.\n"
"Suggestion: start by making a copy of the container and iterate over the items\n"
"of that copy if you want to change that container inside a loop.\n"
msgstr ""
"Siz `{for_while}` siklida konteyner ({container_type}) elementlari\n"
"böyiça iteratsiya qilayotganingizda, unga element qöşiş yoki undan öçirişga urindingiz.\n"
"Taklif: agar sikl içida şu konteynerni özgartirmoqçi bölsangiz, avval undan\n"
"nusxa oling va şu nusxaning elementlari böyiça iteratsiya qiling.\n"

#: runtime_errors\type_error.py:55
