"{first} va {second}.\n"

#: runtime_errors\type_error.py:349
msgid ""
"`{iter}` is an iterator. You likely needed to write something like\n"
"\n"
"    next({iter}())\n"
"\n"
"or use it in a `for` loop to get a number from it\n"
"before comparing it to {number}.\n"
msgstr ""
"`{iter}` — iterator. Ehtimol, {number} bilan taqqoslaşdan oldin\n"
"undan son oliş uçun quyidagiga öxşaş narsa yozişingiz\n"
"\n"
"    next({iter}())\n"
"\n"
"yoki uni `for` siklida işlatişingiz kerak edi.\n"

#: runtime_errors\type_error.py:381
msgid "Perhaps you meant to write `{operator}=` instead of `={operator}`"
msgstr "Ehtimol, `={operator}` örniga `{operator}=` deb yozmoqçi bölgandirsiz"

#: runtime_errors\type_error.py:385
msgid ""
"You tried to use the unary operator '{operator}'\n"
"with the following type of object: {obj}.\n"
"This operation is not defined for this type of object.\n"
msgstr ""
"Siz '{operator}' unar operatorini\n"
"quyidagi turdagi obyekt bilan işlatişga urindingiz: {obj}.\n"
"Bu amal bu turdagi obyekt uçun aniqlanmagan.\n"

#: runtime_errors\type_error.py:411
msgid ""
"In Python, some objects are known as immutable:\n"
"once defined, their value cannot be changed.\n"
"You tried change part of such an immutable object: {obj},\n"
"most likely by using an indexing operation.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pythonda baʼzi obyektlar özgarmas (immutable) deb ataladi:\n"
"ular aniqlangandan keyin qiymatini özgartirib bölmaydi.\n"
"Siz bunday özgarmas obyektning bir qismini özgartirişga urindingiz: {obj},\n"
"ehtimol, indekslaş amali yordamida.\n"

#: runtime_errors\type_error.py:418
msgid "Did you mean to use a list?\n"
msgstr "Röyxatdan foydalanmoqçi bölganmidingiz?\n"

#: runtime_errors\type_error.py:419
msgid "Perhaps you meant to use a list instead.\n"
msgstr "Ehtimol, buning örniga röyxatdan foydalanmoqçi bölgandirsiz.\n"

#: runtime_errors\type_error.py:432
msgid ""
"Exceptions must be derived from `BaseException`.\n"
"It is recommended that user-defined exceptions derive from\n"
"`Exception`, a subclass of `BaseException`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Istisnolar `BaseException` dan hosil qilinişi kerak.\n"
"Foydalanuvçi aniqlagan istisnolar `BaseException` ning quyi klassi bölgan\n"
"`Exception` dan hosil qilinişi tavsiya etiladi.\n"

#: runtime_errors\type_error.py:458
msgid "In an `except` statement, you must only have classes that derive from `BaseException`.\n"
msgstr "`except` operatorida faqat `BaseException` dan hosil qilingan klasslar bölişi kerak.\n"

#: runtime_errors\type_error.py:462
