msgstr ""
"Aftidan, siz `{fn_name}` funksiyasini {nb_given} ta pozitsion\n"
"argument bilan çaqirgansiz, holbuki u {nb_required} ta\n"
"pozitsion argumentni talab qiladi.\n"

#: runtime_errors\type_error.py:509
msgid "Perhaps you forgot `self` when defining `{fn_name}`.\n"
msgstr "Ehtimol, `{fn_name}` ni aniqlaşda `self` ni unutgandirsiz.\n"

#: runtime_errors\type_error.py:529
