"Hozirça bu xatoning ehtimoliy sababini taxmin qila olmayman.\n"
"Körsatilgan qatorni va undan bevosita oldingi qatorni diqqat bilan\n"
"körib çiqib, xato yozilgan söz yoki (, ), [, ], : kabi tuşib qolgan\n"
"belgilarni aniqlay olasizmi, tekşiring.\n"
"\n"
"Agar kodingizda bizning doiramizdan taşqarida bölgan tur annotatsiyalari\n"
"işlatilmagan bölsa va buni friendly qayta işlaşi kerak deb hisoblasangiz,\n"
"iltimos, bu holat haqida quyidagi manzilga xabar bering:\n"
"https://github.com/friendly-traceback/friendly-traceback/issues\n"
"\n"

#: syntax_errors\analyze_syntax.py:72
msgid ""
"Python told us that it expected a colon at the position indicated.\n"
"However, adding a colon or replacing something else by a colon\n"
"would not fix the problem.\n"
msgstr ""
"Python körsatilgan joyda ikki nuqta kutganini aytdi.\n"
"Biroq ikki nuqta qöşiş yoki boşqa narsani ikki nuqta bilan almaştiriş\n"
"muammoni hal qilmaydi.\n"

#: syntax_errors\analyze_syntax.py:86
msgid ""
"Python gave us the following informative message\n"
"about the possible cause of the error:\n"
"\n"
"    {message}\n"
"\n"
"However, I do not recognize this information and I have\n"
"to guess what caused the problem, but I might be wrong.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Python xatoning ehtimoliy sababi haqida\n"
"quyidagi foydali xabarni berdi:\n"
"\n"
"    {message}\n"
"\n"
"Biroq men bu maʼlumotni tanimayman va muammoga nima\n"
"sabab bölganini taxmin qilişim kerak, lekin adaşişim mumkin.\n"
"\n"

#: syntax_errors\error_in_def.py:19 syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:20
msgid ""
"However, making such a change would still not correct\n"
"all the syntax errors in the code you wrote.\n"
msgstr ""
"Biroq bunday özgariş kiritiş ham siz yozgan koddagi\n"
"barça sintaksis xatolarini tuzatmaydi.\n"

#: syntax_errors\error_in_def.py:28
msgid ""
"The correct syntax is:\n"
"\n"
"    {async_}def name ( ... ):"
msgstr ""
"Töğri sintaksis:\n"
"\n"
"    {async_}def name ( ... ):"

#: syntax_errors\error_in_def.py:80
msgid "A function needs a name.\n"
msgstr "Funksiyaga nom kerak.\n"

#: syntax_errors\error_in_def.py:81
msgid "You tried to define a function and did not use the correct syntax.\n"
msgstr "Siz funksiyani aniqlamoqçi bölgansiz, lekin töğri sintaksisdan foydalanmagansiz.\n"

#: syntax_errors\error_in_def.py:85
msgid "Functions and methods need a name.\n"
msgstr "Funksiya va metodlarga nom kerak.\n"

#: syntax_errors\error_in_def.py:86
msgid "You tried to define a function or method and did not use the correct syntax.\n"
msgstr "Siz funksiya yoki metodni aniqlamoqçi bölgansiz, lekin töğri sintaksisdan foydalanmagansiz.\n"

#: syntax_errors\error_in_def.py:116 syntax_errors\error_in_def.py:147 syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:1111
#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:1669 syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:1340
#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:1359
msgid "Did you forget parentheses?\n"
msgstr "Qavslarni unutdingizmi?\n"

#: syntax_errors\error_in_def.py:117 syntax_errors\error_in_def.py:148
msgid ""
"Perhaps you forgot to include parentheses.\n"
"You might have meant to write\n"
"\n"
"    {line}\n"
msgstr ""
"Ehtimol, qavslarni qöşişni unutgandirsiz.\n"
"Balki quyidagini yozmoqçi bölgandirsiz:\n"
"\n"
"    {line}\n"

#: syntax_errors\error_in_def.py:175
msgid "A function definition statement must end with a colon.\n"
msgstr "Funksiya taʼrifi operatori ikki nuqta bilan tugaşi kerak.\n"

#: syntax_errors\error_in_def.py:181 syntax_errors\error_in_def.py:205
msgid "Did you forget to write a colon?\n"
msgstr "Ikki nuqta yozişni unutdingizmi?\n"

#: syntax_errors\error_in_def.py:182 syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:765
msgid "You wrote `{bad}` instead of a colon.\n"
msgstr "Siz ikki nuqta örniga `{bad}` ni yozdingiz.\n"

#: syntax_errors\error_in_def.py:191
msgid "Did you write something by mistake after the colon?\n"
msgstr "Ikki nuqtadan keyin tasodifan biror narsa yozib qöymadingizmi?\n"

#: syntax_errors\error_in_def.py:192
msgid "A block of code must come after the colon.\n"
msgstr "Ikki nuqtadan keyin kod bloki kelişi kerak.\n"

#: syntax_errors\error_in_def.py:193
msgid "Removing `{bad}`, might fix the problem.\n"
msgstr "`{bad}` ni olib taşlaş muammoni hal qilişi mumkin.\n"

#: syntax_errors\error_in_def.py:225
msgid "You cannot use a Python keyword as a function name.\n"
msgstr "Python kalit sözini funksiya nomi sifatida işlatib bölmaydi.\n"

#: syntax_errors\error_in_def.py:226
msgid "You tried to use the Python keyword `{kwd}` as a function name.\n"
msgstr "Siz Pythonning `{kwd}` kalit sözini funksiya nomi sifatida işlatişga urindingiz.\n"

#: syntax_errors\error_in_def.py:234
msgid "There are more syntax errors later in your code.\n"
msgstr "Kodingizning keyingi qismida boşqa sintaksis xatolari ham bor.\n"

#: syntax_errors\error_in_def.py:257
msgid "You wrote an invalid function name.\n"
msgstr "Siz notöğri funksiya nomini yozdingiz.\n"

#: syntax_errors\error_in_def.py:258
msgid ""
"The name of a function must be a valid Python identifier,\n"
"that is a name that begins with a letter or an underscore character, `_`,\n"
"and which contains only letters, digits or the underscore character.\n"
msgstr ""
"Funksiya nomi töğri Python identifikatori bölişi kerak,\n"
"yaʼni harf yoki pastki çiziqça `_` bilan boşlanadigan\n"
"va faqat harflar, raqamlar yoki pastki çiziqçadan iborat nom.\n"

#: syntax_errors\error_in_def.py:264
msgid "You attempted to use a string as a function name.\n"
msgstr "Siz satrni funksiya nomi sifatida işlatişga urindingiz.\n"

#: syntax_errors\error_in_def.py:285
msgid "You forgot to name your function.\n"
msgstr "Funksiyangizga nom berişni unutdingiz.\n"

#: syntax_errors\error_in_def.py:293
msgid "However, there are some other syntax errors in your code.\n"
msgstr "Biroq kodingizda boşqa sintaksis xatolari ham bor.\n"

#: syntax_errors\error_in_def.py:314
msgid ""
"I am guessing that you tried to use the Python keyword\n"
"`{kwd}` as an argument in the definition of a function\n"
"where an identifier (variable name) was expected.\n"
msgstr ""
"Taxminimça, siz funksiya taʼrifida identifikator (özgaruvçi nomi)\n"
"kutilgan joyda Pythonning `{kwd}` kalit sözini\n"
"argument sifatida işlatişga urindingiz.\n"

#: syntax_errors\error_in_def.py:329
msgid "You cannot use dotted names as function arguments.\n"
msgstr "Nuqtali nomlarni funksiya argumentlari sifatida işlatib bölmaydi.\n"

#: syntax_errors\error_in_def.py:331
msgid "Perhaps you meant to write a comma.\n"
msgstr "Ehtimol, siz vergul yozmoqçi bölgandirsiz.\n"

#: syntax_errors\error_in_def.py:332 syntax_errors\error_in_def.py:524 syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:855
#: syntax_errors\syntax_utils.py:119
msgid "Did you mean to write a comma?\n"
msgstr "Vergul yozmoqçi bölganmidingiz?\n"

#: syntax_errors\error_in_def.py:336
msgid "You cannot use dots in function names.\n"
msgstr "Funksiya nomlarida nuqtalardan foydalanib bölmaydi.\n"

#: syntax_errors\error_in_def.py:345
msgid ""
"`/` indicates that the previous arguments in a function definition\n"
"are positional arguments.\n"
msgstr ""
"`/` funksiya taʼrifidagi oldingi argumentlar\n"
"pozitsion argumentlar ekanini bildiradi.\n"

#: syntax_errors\error_in_def.py:351
msgid "Function definitions cannot include the symbol `/` in this Python version.\n"
msgstr "Bu Python versiyasida funksiya taʼriflarida `/` belgisi bölişi mumkin emas.\n"

#: syntax_errors\error_in_def.py:354
msgid ""
"This symbol can only be used with Python versions 3.8.0 or newer.\n"
"You are using Python version {version}.\n"
msgstr ""
"Bu belgidan faqat Python 3.8.0 yoki undan yangi versiyalarda foydalaniş mumkin.\n"
"Siz Python {version} versiyasidan foydalanyapsiz.\n"

#: syntax_errors\error_in_def.py:363
msgid ""
"You have unspecified keyword arguments that appear before\n"
"the symbol `/`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sizda `/` belgisidan oldin keladigan aniqlanmagan\n"
"kalit söz argumentlari bor.\n"

#: syntax_errors\error_in_def.py:367
msgid "Keyword arguments must appear after the `/` symbol.\n"
msgstr "Kalit söz argumentlari `/` belgisidan keyin kelişi kerak.\n"

#: syntax_errors\error_in_def.py:372
msgid ""
"However, `*` indicates that the arguments\n"
"that follow must be keyword arguments.\n"
"When they are used together, `/` must appear before `*`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Biroq `*` undan keyin keladigan argumentlar\n"
"kalit söz argumentlari bölişi kerakligini bildiradi.\n"
"Ular birga işlatilganda `/` `*` dan oldin kelişi kerak.\n"

#: syntax_errors\error_in_def.py:377
msgid "`*` must appear after `/` in a function definition.\n"
msgstr "Funksiya taʼrifida `*` `/` dan keyin kelişi kerak.\n"

#: syntax_errors\error_in_def.py:379
msgid "`*{name}` must appear after `/` in a function definition.\n"
msgstr "Funksiya taʼrifida `*{name}` `/` dan keyin kelişi kerak.\n"

#: syntax_errors\error_in_def.py:386
msgid "You can only use `/` once in a function definition.\n"
msgstr "Funksiya taʼrifida `/` dan faqat bir marta foydalaniş mumkin.\n"

#: syntax_errors\error_in_def.py:400
msgid "You can only use `*` once in a function definition.\n"
msgstr "Funksiya taʼrifida `*` dan faqat bir marta foydalaniş mumkin.\n"

#: syntax_errors\error_in_def.py:406
msgid "You have used it twice, with `*{first}` and `*{second}`.\n"
msgstr "Siz undan `*{first}` va `*{second}` bilan ikki marta foydalandingiz.\n"

#: syntax_errors\error_in_def.py:414
msgid ""
"It must either be used by itself, `*`,\n"
"or in the form `*{args}`, but not both.\n"
msgstr ""
"U yo yolğiz `*` körinişida,\n"
"yo `*{args}` körinişida işlatilişi kerak, lekin ikkalasi birga emas.\n"

#: syntax_errors\error_in_def.py:423
msgid "`*{args}` must appear before `**{kwargs}`.\n"
msgstr "`*{args}` `**{kwargs}` dan oldin kelişi kerak.\n"

#: syntax_errors\error_in_def.py:427
msgid "`**{kwargs}` must appear after the `*` operator.\n"
msgstr "`**{kwargs}` `*` operatoridan keyin kelişi kerak.\n"

#: syntax_errors\error_in_def.py:441
msgid "You cannot use numbers as function arguments.\n"
msgstr "Sonlarni funksiya argumentlari sifatida işlatib bölmaydi.\n"

#: syntax_errors\error_in_def.py:442
msgid ""
"You used a number as an argument when defining a function.\n"
"You can only use identifiers (variable names) as function arguments.\n"
msgstr ""
"Siz funksiyani aniqlaşda sonni argument sifatida işlatdingiz.\n"
"Funksiya argumentlari sifatida faqat identifikatorlardan (özgaruvçi nomlaridan) foydalaniş mumkin.\n"

#: syntax_errors\error_in_def.py:454
msgid "You cannot use strings as function arguments.\n"
msgstr "Satrlarni funksiya argumentlari sifatida işlatib bölmaydi.\n"

#: syntax_errors\error_in_def.py:455
msgid ""
"You used a string as an argument when defining a function.\n"
"You can only use identifiers (variable names) as function arguments.\n"
msgstr ""
"Siz funksiyani aniqlaşda satrni argument sifatida işlatdingiz.\n"
"Funksiya argumentlari sifatida faqat identifikatorlardan (özgaruvçi nomlaridan) foydalaniş mumkin.\n"

#: syntax_errors\error_in_def.py:467
msgid "You cannot have explicit tuples as function arguments.\n"
msgstr "Funksiya argumentlari sifatida aniq körsatilgan kortejlar bölişi mumkin emas.\n"

#: syntax_errors\error_in_def.py:469
msgid ""
"You can only use identifiers (variable names) as function arguments.\n"
"Assign any tuple to a parameter and unpack it\n"
"within the body of the function.\n"
msgstr ""
"Funksiya argumentlari sifatida faqat identifikatorlardan (özgaruvçi nomlaridan) foydalaniş mumkin.\n"
"Kortejni parametrga bering va uni\n"
"funksiya tanasi içida yoying.\n"

#: syntax_errors\error_in_def.py:482
msgid "You cannot have explicit lists as function arguments.\n"
msgstr "Funksiya argumentlari sifatida aniq körsatilgan röyxatlar bölişi mumkin emas.\n"

#: syntax_errors\error_in_def.py:483 syntax_errors\error_in_def.py:495
msgid "You can only use identifiers (variable names) as function arguments.\n"
msgstr "Funksiya argumentlari sifatida faqat identifikatorlardan (özgaruvçi nomlaridan) foydalaniş mumkin.\n"

#: syntax_errors\error_in_def.py:494
msgid "You cannot have any explicit dict or set as function arguments.\n"
msgstr "Funksiya argumentlari sifatida aniq körsatilgan luğat (dict) yoki töplam (set) bölişi mumkin emas.\n"

#: syntax_errors\error_in_def.py:517
msgid "You cannot have operators as function arguments.\n"
msgstr "Funksiya argumentlari sifatida operatorlar bölişi mumkin emas.\n"

#: syntax_errors\error_in_def.py:525
msgid ""
"I suspect you made a typo and wrote `{op}` instead of a comma.\n"
"The following statement contains no syntax error:\n"
"\n"
"    {new_statement}"
msgstr ""
"Menimça, siz xato yozib, vergul örniga `{op}` ni yozgansiz.\n"
"Quyidagi operatorda sintaksis xatosi yöq:\n"
"\n"
"    {new_statement}"

#: syntax_errors\error_in_def.py:537
msgid "Did you mean to write an equal sign?\n"
msgstr "Tenglik belgisini yozmoqçi bölganmidingiz?\n"

#: syntax_errors\error_in_def.py:538
msgid ""
"I suspect you made a typo and wrote `{op}` instead of an equal sign.\n"
"The following statement contains no syntax error:\n"
"\n"
"    {new_statement}"
msgstr ""
"Menimça, siz xato yozib, tenglik belgisi örniga `{op}` ni yozgansiz.\n"
"Quyidagi operatorda sintaksis xatosi yöq:\n"
"\n"
"    {new_statement}"

#: syntax_errors\error_in_def.py:550
msgid "Did you mean to write `{op}`?\n"
msgstr "`{op}` ni yozmoqçi bölganmidingiz?\n"

#: syntax_errors\error_in_def.py:551
msgid ""
"I suspect you made a typo and added `{op}` by mistake.\n"
"The following statement contains no syntax error:\n"
"\n"
"    {new_statement}"
msgstr ""
"Menimça, siz xato yozib, `{op}` ni tasodifan qöşib qöygansiz.\n"
"Quyidagi operatorda sintaksis xatosi yöq:\n"
"\n"
"    {new_statement}"

#: syntax_errors\error_in_def.py:567
msgid "You cannot use `{op}` as an argument.\n"
msgstr "`{op}` ni argument sifatida işlatib bölmaydi.\n"

#: syntax_errors\error_in_def.py:571
msgid ""
"I suspect you made a typo and wrote `{op}` by mistake.\n"
"If you replace it by a unique variable name, the result\n"
"will contain no syntax error.\n"
msgstr ""
"Menimça, siz xato yozib, `{op}` ni tasodifan yozib qöygansiz.\n"
"Agar uni takrorlanmas özgaruvçi nomi bilan almaştirsangiz,\n"
"natijada sintaksis xatosi bölmaydi.\n"

#: syntax_errors\error_in_def.py:579
msgid ""
"I suspect you made a typo and wrote `{op}` by mistake,\n"
"perhaps instead of writing an identifier (variable name).\n"
msgstr ""
"Menimça, siz xato yozib, `{op}` ni tasodifan yozib qöygansiz,\n"
"ehtimol, identifikator (özgaruvçi nomi) yoziş örniga.\n"

#: syntax_errors\error_in_def.py:588
msgid "The `**` operator needs to be followed by an identifier (variable name).\n"
msgstr "`**` operatoridan keyin identifikator (özgaruvçi nomi) kelişi kerak.\n"

#: syntax_errors\error_in_def.py:611
msgid "Positional arguments must come before keyword arguments.\n"
msgstr "Pozitsion argumentlar kalit söz argumentlaridan oldin kelişi kerak.\n"

#: syntax_errors\error_in_def.py:612
msgid ""
"`{arg}` is a positional argument that appears after one or more\n"
"keyword arguments in your function definition.\n"
msgstr ""
"`{arg}` — funksiya taʼrifingizda bir yoki bir neçta kalit söz argumentidan\n"
"keyin kelgan pozitsion argument.\n"

#: syntax_errors\indentation_error.py:11
msgid "Line `{number}` identified above is more indented than expected.\n"
msgstr "Yuqorida körsatilgan `{number}`-qator kutilganidan köproq çekiniş bilan yozilgan.\n"

#: syntax_errors\indentation_error.py:15
msgid "Line `{number}` identified above was expected to begin a new indented block.\n"
msgstr "Yuqorida körsatilgan `{number}`-qator çekiniş bilan yozilgan yangi blokni boşlaşi kutilgan edi.\n"

#: syntax_errors\indentation_error.py:20
msgid "Line `{number}` identified above is less indented than expected.\n"
msgstr "Yuqorida körsatilgan `{number}`-qator kutilganidan kamroq çekiniş bilan yozilgan.\n"

#: syntax_errors\indentation_error.py:32
msgid ""
"However, line {number}, which is identified as having a problem,\n"
"consists of a single string which is also the case\n"
"for the preceding line.\n"
"Perhaps you meant to include a continuation character, `\\`,\n"
"at the end of line {preceding}.\n"
msgstr ""
"Biroq muammoli deb körsatilgan {number}-qator\n"
"oldingi qator kabi faqat bitta satrdan\n"
"iborat.\n"
"Ehtimol, siz {preceding}-qator oxiriga davom ettiriş belgisi `\\`\n"
"ni qöyişni xohlagandirsiz.\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:22
msgid "You can only assign objects to identifiers (variable names).\n"
msgstr "Obyektlarni faqat identifikatorlarga (özgaruvçi nomlariga) beriş mumkin.\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:26 syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:1685
msgid ""
"You can only delete names of objects, or items in mutable containers\n"
"such as `list`, `set`, or `dict`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Faqat obyekt nomlarini yoki `list`, `set` yoki `dict` kabi\n"
"özgaruvçan konteynerlardagi elementlarni öçiriş mumkin.\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:54
msgid "of type `int`"
msgstr "`int` turidagi"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:55
msgid "of type `complex`"
msgstr "`complex` turidagi"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:56
msgid "of type `float`"
msgstr "`float` turidagi"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:57
msgid "of type `str`"
msgstr "`str` turidagi"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:58
msgid "of type `dict`"
msgstr "`dict` turidagi"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:59
msgid "of type `list`"
msgstr "`list` turidagi"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:60
msgid "of type `set`"
msgstr "`set` turidagi"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:61
msgid "of type `tuple`"
msgstr "`tuple` turidagi"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:81 syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:91
msgid "Did you mean `{num}`?\n"
msgstr "`{num}` ni nazarda tutdingizmi?\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:82
msgid ""
"Perhaps you meant to write the octal number `{num}`\n"
"and forgot the letter 'o', or perhaps you meant to write\n"
"a decimal integer and did not know that it could not start with zeros.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ehtimol, siz `{num}` sakkizlik sonini yozmoqçi bölib, 'o' harfini\n"
"unutgansiz yoki önlik butun sonni yozmoqçi bölib,\n"
"u nollar bilan boşlana olmasligini bilmagansiz.\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:92
msgid ""
"Perhaps you meant to write the integer `{num}`\n"
"and did not know that it could not start with zeros.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ehtimol, siz `{num}` butun sonini yozmoqçi bölib,\n"
"u nollar bilan boşlana olmasligini bilmagansiz.\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:131
msgid ""
"On the left-hand side of an equal sign, you have a\n"
"conditional expression instead of the name of a variable.\n"
"A conditional expression has the following form:\n"
"\n"
"    variable = object if condition else other_object\n"
msgstr ""
"Tenglik belgisining çap tomonida özgaruvçi nomi örniga\n"
"şartli ifoda turibdi.\n"
"Şartli ifoda quyidagi körinişga ega:\n"
"\n"
"    variable = object if condition else other_object\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:149
msgid ""
"On the left-hand side of an equal sign, you have a\n"
"conditional expression instead of the name of a variable.\n"
"    {expression} = ...\n"
"    {mark}\n"
msgstr ""
"Tenglik belgisining çap tomonida özgaruvçi nomi örniga\n"
"şartli ifoda turibdi.\n"
"    {expression} = ...\n"
"    {mark}\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:170
msgid ""
"On the left-hand side of an equal sign, you have\n"
"an expression instead of the name of a variable.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tenglik belgisining çap tomonida özgaruvçi nomi örniga\n"
"ifoda turibdi.\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:195
msgid ""
"You wrote the expression\n"
"\n"
"    {fn_call} = ...\n"
"where `{fn_call}`, on the left-hand side of the equal sign, either is\n"
"or includes a function call and is not simply the name of a variable.\n"
msgstr ""
"Siz quyidagi ifodani yozdingiz:\n"
"\n"
"    {fn_call} = ...\n"
"bu yerda tenglik belgisining çap tomonidagi `{fn_call}` funksiya çaqiruvining özi\n"
"yoki uni öz içiga oladi va şunçaki özgaruvçi nomi emas.\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:207
msgid ""
"You wrote the expression\n"
"\n"
"    {fn_call} = ...\n"
"    {mark}\n"
"where `{fn_call}`, on the left-hand side of the equal sign, either is\n"
"or includes a function call and is not simply the name of a variable.\n"
msgstr ""
"Siz quyidagi ifodani yozdingiz:\n"
"\n"
"    {fn_call} = ...\n"
"    {mark}\n"
"bu yerda tenglik belgisining çap tomonidagi `{fn_call}` funksiya çaqiruvining özi\n"
"yoki uni öz içiga oladi va şunçaki özgaruvçi nomi emas.\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:228
msgid ""
"On the left-hand side of an equal sign, you have a\n"
"generator expression instead of the name of a variable.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tenglik belgisining çap tomonida özgaruvçi nomi örniga\n"
"generator ifodasi turibdi.\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:246 syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:372
msgid ""
"You wrote an expression that has the f-string `{fstring}`\n"
"on the left-hand side of the equal sign.\n"
"An f-string should only appear on the right-hand side of an equal sign.\n"
msgstr ""
"Siz tenglik belgisining çap tomonida `{fstring}` f-satri bölgan\n"
"ifodani yozdingiz.\n"
"f-satr faqat tenglik belgisining öng tomonida kelişi kerak.\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:290 syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:1018
msgid "You cannot assign a value to `{keyword}`.\n"
msgstr "`{keyword}` ga qiymat berib bölmaydi.\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:293
msgid "You cannot assign a value to the ellipsis symbol [`...`].\n"
msgstr "Köp nuqta belgisiga [`...`] qiymat berib bölmaydi.\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:294
msgid "The ellipsis symbol `...` is a constant in Python;you cannot assign it a different value.\n"
msgstr "Köp nuqta belgisi `...` Pythonda konstanta; unga boşqa qiymat bera olmaysiz.\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:299
msgid "`{keyword}` is a constant in Python; you cannot assign it a different value.\n"
msgstr "`{keyword}` Pythonda konstanta; unga boşqa qiymat bera olmaysiz.\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:304 syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:1049
msgid ""
"You were trying to assign a value to the Python keyword `{keyword}`.\n"
"This is not allowed.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Siz Pythonning `{keyword}` kalit söziga qiymat berişga urindingiz.\n"
"Bunga ruxsat yöq.\n"
"\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:324
msgid ""
"A for loop must have the form:\n"
"\n"
"    for ... in sequence:\n"
"\n"
"where `...` must contain only identifiers (variable names)\n"
"and not literals like `{bad_token}`.\n"
msgstr ""
"For sikli quyidagi körinişga ega bölişi kerak:\n"
"\n"
"    for ... in sequence:\n"
"\n"
"bu yerda `...` faqat identifikatorlardan (özgaruvçi nomlaridan) iborat bölişi kerak,\n"
"`{bad_token}` kabi literallardan emas.\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:381
msgid "variable_name"
msgstr "variable_name"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:385
msgid ""
"Perhaps you meant to write:\n"
"\n"
"    {name} = {literal}\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Ehtimol, siz quyidagini yozmoqçi bölgandirsiz:\n"
"\n"
"    {name} = {literal}\n"
"\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:391
msgid "Perhaps you meant to write `{name} = {literal}`"
msgstr "Ehtimol, siz `{name} = {literal}` deb yozmoqçi bölgandirsiz"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:410
msgid ""
"You wrote an expression like\n"
"\n"
"    {literal} = {name}\n"
"where `{literal}`, on the left-hand side of the equal sign,\n"
"is or includes an actual object {of_type}\n"
"and is not simply the name of a variable.\n"
msgstr ""
"Siz quyidagiga öxşaş ifodani yozdingiz:\n"
"\n"
"    {literal} = {name}\n"
"bu yerda tenglik belgisining çap tomonidagi `{literal}`\n"
"{of_type} haqiqiy obyektning özi yoki uni öz içiga oladi\n"
"va şunçaki özgaruvçi nomi emas.\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:420
msgid ""
"It is possible that you used an equal sign `=` instead of a colon `:`\n"
"to assign values to keys in a dict.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ehtimol, siz luğatda kalitlarga qiymat beriş uçun\n"
"ikki nuqta `:` örniga tenglik belgisi `=` dan foydalangansiz.\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:438
msgid ""
"You wrote an expression that includes some mathematical operations\n"
"on the left-hand side of the equal sign which should be\n"
"only used to assign a value to a variable.\n"
msgstr ""
"Siz tenglik belgisining çap tomonida baʼzi matematik amallarni\n"
"öz içiga olgan ifodani yozdingiz, holbuki u yerda faqat\n"
"özgaruvçiga qiymat beriş bölişi kerak.\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:460
msgid "Perhaps you meant to write `{name}` instead of `{original}`\n"
msgstr "Ehtimol, siz `{original}` örniga `{name}` deb yozmoqçi bölgandirsiz\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:465 syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:603 syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:635
msgid "Perhaps you needed `==` instead of `=`.\n"
msgstr "Ehtimol, sizga `=` örniga `==` kerak edi.\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:477
msgid ""
"You wrote an expression that includes the `yield` keyword\n"
"on the left-hand side of the equal sign.\n"
"You cannot assign a value to such an expression.\n"
"Note that, like the keyword `return`,\n"
"`yield` can only be used inside a function.\n"
msgstr ""
"Siz tenglik belgisining çap tomonida `yield` kalit sözini\n"
"öz içiga olgan ifodani yozdingiz.\n"
"Bunday ifodaga qiymat berib bölmaydi.\n"
"Eʼtibor bering, `return` kalit sözi kabi\n"
"`yield` ham faqat funksiya içida işlatilişi mumkin.\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:496 syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:518
msgid ""
"You are using the augmented assignment operator `:=` inside\n"
"a comprehension to assign a value to the iteration variable `{var}`.\n"
"This variable is meant to be used only inside the comprehension.\n"
"The augmented assignment operator is normally used to assign a value\n"
"to a variable so that the variable can be reused later.\n"
"This is not possible for variable `{var}`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Siz `{var}` iteratsiya özgaruvçisiga qiymat beriş uçun röyxat ifodasi (comprehension)\n"
"içida kengaytirilgan qiymat beriş operatori `:=` dan foydalanyapsiz.\n"
"Bu özgaruvçi faqat röyxat ifodasi (comprehension) içida işlatiliş uçun möljallangan.\n"
"Kengaytirilgan qiymat beriş operatori odatda özgaruvçidan keyinroq\n"
"qayta foydalaniş uçun unga qiymat beriş maqsadida işlatiladi.\n"
"`{var}` özgaruvçisi uçun bu mumkin emas.\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:535
msgid ""
"The object named `{name}` is defined with type annotation\n"
"as a local variable. It cannot be declared to be a global variable.\n"
msgstr ""
"`{name}` nomli obyekt tur annotatsiyasi bilan lokal özgaruvçi\n"
"sifatida aniqlangan. Uni global özgaruvçi deb eʼlon qilib bölmaydi.\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:550
msgid ""
"You cannot use the augmented assignment operator `:=`,\n"
"sometimes called the walrus operator, with literals like `{bad_token}`.\n"
"You can only assign objects to identifiers (variable names).\n"
msgstr ""
"Baʼzan \"morj operatori\" (walrus operator) deb ataladigan kengaytirilgan qiymat beriş\n"
"operatori `:=` ni `{bad_token}` kabi literallar bilan işlatib bölmaydi.\n"
"Obyektlarni faqat identifikatorlarga (özgaruvçi nomlariga) beriş mumkin.\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:561
msgid ""
"You declared `{name}` as being both a global and nonlocal variable.\n"
"A variable can be global, or nonlocal, but not both at the same time.\n"
msgstr ""
"Siz `{name}` ni ham global, ham nonlocal özgaruvçi deb eʼlon qildingiz.\n"
"Özgaruvçi global yoki nonlocal bölişi mumkin, lekin bir vaqtning özida ikkalasi emas.\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:576
msgid "Python tells us that the {bracket} was never closed.\n"
msgstr "Python {bracket} heç qaçon yopilmaganini aytyapti.\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:579
msgid "The {bracket} was never closed.\n"
msgstr "{bracket} heç qaçon yopilmagan.\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:591
msgid "The Python keyword `break` can only be used inside a `for` loop or inside a `while` loop.\n"
msgstr "Pythonning `break` kalit sözi faqat `for` sikli yoki `while` sikli içida işlatilişi mumkin.\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:604 syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:636
msgid "You likely used an assignment operator `=` instead of an equality operator `==`.\n"
msgstr "Ehtimol, siz tenglik operatori `==` örniga qiymat beriş operatori `=` dan foydalangansiz.\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:612
msgid ""
"The following statement would not contain a syntax error:\n"
"\n"
"    {new_statement}\n"
msgstr ""
"Quyidagi operatorda sintaksis xatosi bölmaydi:\n"
"\n"
"    {new_statement}\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:632
msgid "You cannot delete the constant `{constant}`.\n"
msgstr "`{constant}` konstantasini öçirib bölmaydi.\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:652 syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:706
msgid "You cannot delete a Python expression.\n"
msgstr "Python ifodasini öçirib bölmaydi.\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:655
msgid "You cannot delete the expression `{expression}`.\n"
msgstr "`{expression}` ifodasini öçirib bölmaydi.\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:672
msgid ""
"You attempted to delete a function call\n"
"\n"
"    {line}\n"
"instead of deleting the function's name\n"
"\n"
"    {correct}\n"
msgstr ""
"Siz funksiya nomini öçiriş örniga\n"
"\n"
"    {correct}\n"
"\n"
"funksiya çaqiruvini öçirişga urindingiz:\n"
"\n"
"    {line}\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:690
msgid "You cannot delete the literal `{literal}`.\n"
msgstr "`{literal}` literalini öçirib bölmaydi.\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:709
msgid "You cannot delete the named expression `{expression}`.\n"
msgstr "`{expression}` nomli ifodani öçirib bölmaydi.\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:725
msgid ""
"The star operator `*` is interpreted to mean that\n"
"iterable unpacking is to be used to assign a name\n"
"to each item of an iterable, which does not make sense here.\n"
msgstr ""
"Yulduzça operatori `*` iteratsiya qilinadigan obyektning har bir elementiga\n"
"nom beriş uçun yoyiş (unpacking) işlatilişi kerak deb tuşuniladi,\n"
"bu esa bu yerda maʼnoga ega emas.\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:739
msgid ""
"It looks like you surrounded a starred name by parentheses.\n"
"This was not considered a SyntaxError before Python version 3.9.\n"
msgstr ""
"Aftidan, siz yulduzçali nomni qavslar içiga olgansiz.\n"
"Python 3.9 versiyasidan oldin bu SyntaxError hisoblanmagan.\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:758
msgid "Did you forget a colon?\n"
msgstr "Ikki nuqtani unutdingizmi?\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:759
msgid "Python expected a colon at the position indicated.\n"
msgstr "Python körsatilgan joyda ikki nuqta kutgan edi.\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:787
msgid ""
"It looks like the error occurred as you were writing a Python dict.\n"
"Perhaps you wrote a dict key without writing the corresponding value.\n"
msgstr ""
"Aftidan, xato Python luğatini (dict) yozayotganingizda yuz bergan.\n"
"Ehtimol, luğat kalitini unga mos qiymatsiz yozgandirsiz.\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:791 syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:1049 syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:1753
msgid "Did you forget to write a dict value?\n"
msgstr "Luğat qiymatini yozişni unutdingizmi?\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:798
msgid "The Python keyword `continue` can only be used inside a `for` loop or inside a `while` loop.\n"
msgstr "Pythonning `continue` kalit sözi faqat `for` sikli yoki `while` sikli içida işlatilişi mumkin.\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:810
msgid ""
"You have defined a function repeating the argument\n"
"\n"
"    {name}\n"
"Each argument should appear only once in a function definition.\n"
msgstr ""
"Siz quyidagi argumentni takrorlagan funksiyani aniqladingiz:\n"
"\n"
"    {name}\n"
"Funksiya taʼrifida har bir argument faqat bir marta kelişi kerak.\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:850
msgid "Did you forget to add `else`?\n"
msgstr "`else` ni qöşişni unutdingizmi?\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:851
msgid "An `else some_value` clause was expected after the `if` expression.\n"
msgstr "`if` ifodasidan keyin `else some_value` qismi kutilgan edi.\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:863
msgid ""
"You started writing a triple-quoted string but never wrote\n"
"the triple quotes needed to end the string.\n"
msgstr ""
"Siz uçtalik qöştirnoqli satr yozişni boşladingiz, lekin\n"
"satrni tugatiş uçun kerakli uçtalik qöştirnoqlarni heç qaçon yozmadingiz.\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:880
msgid "Did you forget a closing quote?\n"
msgstr "Yopuvçi qöştirnoqni unutdingizmi?\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:881
msgid ""
"You started writing a string with a single or double quote\n"
"but never ended the string with another quote on that line.\n"
msgstr ""
"Siz yakka yoki qöş qöştirnoq bilan satr yozişni boşladingiz,\n"
"lekin şu qatorda satrni boşqa qöştirnoq bilan tugatmadingiz.\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:894
msgid ""
"Perhaps you meant to write the backslash character, `\\`\n"
"as the last character in the string and forgot that you\n"
"needed to escape it by writing two `\\` in a row.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ehtimol, siz satrning oxirgi belgisi sifatida teskari egri çiziq `\\`\n"
"belgisini yozmoqçi bölgansiz va uni ekranlaş uçun ketma-ket\n"
"ikkita `\\` yoziş kerakligini unutgansiz.\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:899
msgid "Did you forget to escape a backslash character?\n"
msgstr "Teskari egri çiziq belgisini ekranlaşni unutdingizmi?\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:934 syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:403
msgid "Perhaps you forgot to escape a quote character.\n"
msgstr "Ehtimol, qöştirnoq belgisini ekranlaşni unutgandirsiz.\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:935 syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:404
msgid ""
"I suspect that you were trying to use a quote character inside a string\n"
"that was enclosed in quotes of the same kind.\n"
"Perhaps you should have escaped the inner quote character:\n"
"\n"
"    {new_line}\n"
"    {mark}\n"
msgstr ""
"Menimça, siz xuddi şu turdagi qöştirnoqlarga olingan satr içida\n"
"qöştirnoq belgisidan foydalanmoqçi bölgansiz.\n"
"Ehtimol, içki qöştirnoq belgisini ekranlaşingiz kerak edi:\n"
"\n"
"    {new_line}\n"
"    {mark}\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:950
msgid "You wrote a `try` block which did not include an `except` nor a `finally` block.\n"
msgstr "Siz `except` ham, `finally` ham bloki bölmagan `try` blokini yozdingiz.\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:965 syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:982
msgid ""
"Perhaps you meant to write\n"
"\n"
"    {new_statement}"
msgstr ""
"Ehtimol, siz quyidagini yozmoqçi bölgandirsiz:\n"
"\n"
"    {new_statement}"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:968 syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:985
msgid "Did you mean `{new_statement}`?"
msgstr "`{new_statement}` ni nazarda tutdingizmi?"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:975
msgid ""
"Perhaps you meant to write either\n"
"\n"
"    {new_statement}\n"
"\n"
"or\n"
"\n"
"    {new_statement2}"
msgstr ""
"Ehtimol, siz yo\n"
"\n"
"    {new_statement}\n"
"\n"
"yoki\n"
"\n"
"    {new_statement2}"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:1020
msgid ""
"You likely called a function using the Python keyword `{keyword}` as an argument:\n"
"\n"
"    a_function({keyword}=something) \n"
"\n"
"which Python interpreted as trying to assign a value to a Python keyword.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Ehtimol, siz funksiyani Pythonning `{keyword}` kalit sözini argument sifatida işlatib çaqirgansiz:\n"
"\n"
"    a_function({keyword}=something)\n"
"\n"
"Python buni Python kalit söziga qiymat berişga uriniş deb tuşundi.\n"
"\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:1031
msgid ""
"You likely called a function with a named argument:\n"
"\n"
"    a_function(invalid=something) \n"
"\n"
"where `invalid` is not a valid variable name in Python\n"
"either because it starts with a number, or is a string,\n"
"or contains a period, etc.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ehtimol, siz funksiyani nomlangan argument bilan çaqirgansiz:\n"
"\n"
"    a_function(invalid=something)\n"
"\n"
"bu yerda `invalid` Pythonda töğri özgaruvçi nomi emas,\n"
"çunki u raqam bilan boşlanadi yoki satr,\n"
"yoki nuqtani öz içiga oladi va hokazo.\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:1045 syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:1744
msgid ""
"It looks like the error occurred as you were writing a Python dict.\n"
"Perhaps you forgot to write a value after a colon.\n"
msgstr ""
"Aftidan, xato Python luğatini (dict) yozayotganingizda yuz bergan.\n"
"Ehtimol, ikki nuqtadan keyin qiymat yozişni unutgandirsiz.\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:1058
msgid ""
"You have written an f-string whose content `{...}`\n"
"includes a backslash; this is not allowed.\n"
"Perhaps you can replace the part that contains a backslash by\n"
"some variable. For example, suppose that you have an f-string like:\n"
"\n"
"    f\"{... 'hello\\n' ...}\"\n"
"\n"
"you could write this as\n"
"\n"
"    hello = 'hello\\n'\n"
"    f\"{... hello ...}\"\n"
msgstr ""
"Siz mazmuni `{...}` teskari egri çiziqni öz içiga olgan\n"
"f-satr yozdingiz; bunga ruxsat yöq.\n"
"Ehtimol, teskari egri çiziq bölgan qismni biror özgaruvçi bilan\n"
"almaştiriş mumkin. Masalan, sizda quyidagiga öxşaş f-satr bor deylik:\n"
"\n"
"    f\"{... 'hello\\n' ...}\"\n"
"\n"
"uni quyidagiça yozişingiz mumkin:\n"
"\n"
"    hello = 'hello\\n'\n"
"    f\"{... hello ...}\"\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:1075
msgid ""
"You have written an f-string which has an unmatched `}`.\n"
"If you want to print a single `}`, you need to write `}}` in the f-string;\n"
"otherwise, you need to add an opening `{`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Siz juftsiz `}` bölgan f-satr yozdingiz.\n"
"Agar bitta `}` ni çop etmoqçi bölsangiz, f-satrda `}}` deb yozişingiz kerak;\n"
"aks holda oçuvçi `{` ni qöşişingiz kerak.\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:1087
msgid ""
"You have written an f-string which has an unmatched `{`.\n"
"If you want to print a single `{`, you need to write `{{` in the f-string;\n"
"otherwise, you need to add a closing `}`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Siz juftsiz `{` bölgan f-satr yozdingiz.\n"
"Agar bitta `{` ni çop etmoqçi bölsangiz, f-satrda `{{` deb yozişingiz kerak;\n"
"aks holda yopuvçi `}` ni qöşişingiz kerak.\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:1103 syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:1312
msgid ""
"I am guessing that you were writing a comprehension or a generator expression\n"
"and forgot to include parentheses around tuples.\n"
"As an example, instead of writing\n"
"\n"
"    [i, i**2 for i in range(10)]\n"
"\n"
"you would need to write\n"
"\n"
"    [(i, i**2) for i in range(10)]\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Taxminimça, siz röyxat ifodasi (comprehension) yoki generator ifodasini yozayotgan edingiz\n"
"va kortejlarni qavslarga olişni unutgansiz.\n"
"Masalan,\n"
"\n"
"    [i, i**2 for i in range(10)]\n"
"\n"
"örniga quyidagini yozişingiz kerak:\n"
"\n"
"    [(i, i**2) for i in range(10)]\n"
"\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:1120
msgid ""
"A `from __future__ import` statement changes the way Python\n"
"interprets the code in a file.\n"
"It must appear at the beginning of the file."
msgstr ""
"`from __future__ import` operatori Python fayldagi kodni\n"
"qanday tuşunişini özgartiradi.\n"
"U fayl boşida kelişi kerak."

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:1136
msgid "The available features are `{names}`.\n"
msgstr "Mavjud imkoniyatlar: `{names}`.\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:1141
msgid ""
"When using a `from __future__ import` statement,\n"
"you must import specific named features.\n"
msgstr ""
"`from __future__ import` operatoridan foydalanganda\n"
"aniq nomlangan imkoniyatlarni import qilişingiz kerak.\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:1152
msgid "Instead of `{feature}`, perhaps you meant to import `{name}`.\n"
msgstr "`{feature}` örniga, ehtimol, `{name}` ni import qilmoqçi bölgandirsiz.\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:1157
msgid "`{feature}` is not a valid feature of module `__future__`.\n"
msgstr "`{feature}` — `__future__` modulining töğri imkoniyati emas.\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:1182
msgid ""
"You are using a generator expression, something of the form\n"
"\n"
"    x for x in thing\n"
"\n"
"You must add parentheses enclosing that expression.\n"
msgstr ""
"Siz quyidagi körinişdagi generator ifodasidan foydalanyapsiz:\n"
"\n"
"    x for x in thing\n"
"\n"
"Bu ifodani qavslar içiga olişingiz kerak.\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:1195
msgid ""
"I suspect you wrote `from __future__ import braces` following\n"
"someone else's suggestion. This will never work.\n"
"\n"
"Unlike other programming languages, Python's code block are defined by\n"
"their indentation level, and not by using some curly braces, like `{...}`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Menimça, siz kimningdir maslahatiga amal qilib, `from __future__ import braces`\n"
"deb yozgansiz. Bu heç qaçon işlamaydi.\n"
"\n"
"Boşqa dasturlaş tillaridan farqli ölaroq, Pythonda kod bloklari\n"
"`{...}` kabi jingalak qavslar bilan emas, çekiniş darajasi bilan belgilanadi.\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:1210 syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:214
msgid "Did you use copy-paste?\n"
msgstr "Nusxa olib joylaştirişdan foydalandingizmi?\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:1211
msgid ""
"Python indicates that you used the unicode character `{bad_character}`\n"
"which is not allowed.\n"
msgstr ""
"Python siz ruxsat etilmagan `{bad_character}` unicode belgisidan\n"
"foydalanganingizni körsatyapti.\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:1237
msgid "Python tells us that you have written an invalid number."
msgstr "Python siz notöğri son yozganingizni aytyapti."

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:1238
msgid "However, I think that the problem might be the following."
msgstr "Biroq menimça, muammo quyidagida bölişi mumkin."

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:1272
msgid "I have no suggestion to offer to fix this problem.\n"
msgstr "Bu muammoni hal qiliş uçun taklif qiladigan heç narsam yöq.\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:1281 syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:768
msgid ""
"The double star operator `**` is likely interpreted to mean that\n"
"dict unpacking is to be used which is not allowed or does not make sense here.\n"
msgstr ""
"Qöş yulduzça operatori `**`, ehtimol, luğatni yoyiş (dict unpacking)\n"
"işlatilişi kerak deb tuşuniladi, bu esa bu yerda ruxsat etilmagan yoki maʼnoga ega emas.\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:1339
msgid ""
"You cannot use the `*` operator to unpack the iteration variable\n"
"in a comprehension.\n"
msgstr ""
"Röyxat ifodasi (comprehension) içida iteratsiya özgaruvçisini yoyiş uçun\n"
"`*` operatoridan foydalanib bölmaydi.\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:1351 syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:1761 syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:552
msgid ""
"The following statement has no syntax error:\n"
"\n"
"    {statement}\n"
msgstr ""
"Quyidagi operatorda sintaksis xatosi yöq:\n"
"\n"
"    {statement}\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:1372
msgid ""
"You have called a function repeating the same keyword argument (`{arg}`).\n"
"Each keyword argument should appear only once in a function call.\n"
msgstr ""
"Siz funksiyani bir xil kalit söz argumentini (`{arg}`) takrorlab çaqirdingiz.\n"
"Funksiya çaqiruvida har bir kalit söz argumenti faqat bir marta kelişi kerak.\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:1435
msgid ""
"Python tells us that the closing `{closing}` on the last line shown\n"
"does not match the opening `{opening}` on line {lineno}.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Python körsatilgan oxirgi qatordagi yopuvçi `{closing}`\n"
"{lineno}-qatordagi oçuvçi `{opening}` ga mos kelmasligini aytyapti.\n"
"\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:1440
msgid ""
"Python tells us that the closing `{closing}` on the last line shown\n"
"does not match the opening `{opening}`.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Python körsatilgan oxirgi qatordagi yopuvçi `{closing}`\n"
"oçuvçi `{opening}` ga mos kelmasligini aytyapti.\n"
"\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:1454
msgid "Did you forget something after `*`?\n"
msgstr "`*` dan keyin biror narsani unutdingizmi?\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:1455
msgid ""
"Assuming you were defining a function, you need\n"
"to replace `*` by either `*arguments` or\n"
"by `*, named_argument=value`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Agar siz funksiya aniqlayotgan bölsangiz, `*` ni\n"
"`*arguments` yoki `*, named_argument=value`\n"
"bilan almaştirişingiz kerak.\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:1470
msgid ""
"You assigned a value to the variable `{name}`\n"
"before declaring it as a global variable.\n"
msgstr ""
"Siz `{name}` özgaruvçisini global özgaruvçi deb eʼlon qilişdan\n"
"oldin unga qiymat berdingiz.\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:1494
msgid "Did you forget to add `nonlocal`?\n"
msgstr "`nonlocal` ni qöşişni unutdingizmi?\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:1495
msgid ""
"You assigned a value to the variable `{name}`\n"
"before declaring it as a nonlocal variable.\n"
msgstr ""
"Siz `{name}` özgaruvçisini nonlocal özgaruvçi deb eʼlon qilişdan\n"
"oldin unga qiymat berdingiz.\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:1526
msgid ""
"You are including the statement\n"
"\n"
"    {newline}\n"
"\n"
"indicating that `{name}` is a variable defined outside a function.\n"
"You are also using the same `{name}` as an argument for that\n"
"function, thus indicating that it should be variable known only\n"
"inside that function, which is the contrary of what `global` implied.\n"
msgstr ""
"Siz quyidagi operatorni qöşyapsiz:\n"
"\n"
"    {newline}\n"
"\n"
"u `{name}` funksiyadan taşqarida aniqlangan özgaruvçi ekanini bildiradi.\n"
"Siz xuddi şu `{name}` ni şu funksiyaning argumenti sifatida ham işlatyapsiz,\n"
"bu esa u faqat şu funksiya içida maʼlum özgaruvçi bölişi kerakligini bildiradi,\n"
"bu `global` anglatgan narsaning aksi.\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:1543
msgid ""
"You used `{name}` as a parameter for a function\n"
"before declaring it also as a nonlocal variable:\n"
"`{name}` cannot be both at the same time.\n"
msgstr ""
"Siz `{name}` ni nonlocal özgaruvçi deb ham eʼlon qilişdan oldin\n"
"uni funksiya parametri sifatida işlatdingiz:\n"
"`{name}` bir vaqtning özida ikkalasi ham böla olmaydi.\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:1558
msgid ""
"You used the variable `{name}`\n"
"before declaring it as a global variable.\n"
msgstr ""
"Siz `{name}` özgaruvçisini global özgaruvçi deb eʼlon qilişdan\n"
"oldin undan foydalandingiz.\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:1581
msgid "Did you forget to write `nonlocal` first?\n"
msgstr "Avval `nonlocal` ni yozişni unutdingizmi?\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:1583
msgid ""
"You used the variable `{name}`\n"
"before declaring it as a nonlocal variable.\n"
msgstr ""
"Siz `{name}` özgaruvçisini nonlocal özgaruvçi deb eʼlon qilişdan\n"
"oldin undan foydalandingiz.\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:1607
msgid ""
"You declared the variable `{name}` as being a\n"
"nonlocal variable but it cannot be found.\n"
msgstr ""
"Siz `{name}` özgaruvçisini nonlocal özgaruvçi deb\n"
"eʼlon qildingiz, lekin uni topib bölmayapti.\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:1618
msgid ""
"You used the nonlocal keyword at a module level.\n"
"The nonlocal keyword refers to a variable inside a function\n"
"given a value outside that function."
msgstr ""
"Siz nonlocal kalit sözini modul darajasida işlatdingiz.\n"
"nonlocal kalit sözi funksiya içidagi, şu funksiyadan\n"
"taşqarida qiymat berilgan özgaruvçini bildiradi."

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:1633
msgid ""
"In Python, you can define functions with only positional arguments\n"
"\n"
"    def test(a, b, c): ...\n"
"\n"
"or only keyword arguments\n"
"\n"
"    def test(a=1, b=2, c=3): ...\n"
"\n"
"or a combination of the two\n"
"\n"
"    def test(a, b, c=3): ...\n"
"\n"
"but with the keyword arguments appearing after all the positional ones.\n"
"According to Python, you used positional arguments after keyword ones.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pythonda funksiyalarni faqat pozitsion argumentlar bilan\n"
"\n"
"    def test(a, b, c): ...\n"
"\n"
"yoki faqat kalit söz argumentlari bilan\n"
"\n"
"    def test(a=1, b=2, c=3): ...\n"
"\n"
"yoki ikkalasining birikmasi bilan aniqlaş mumkin\n"
"\n"
"    def test(a, b, c=3): ...\n"
"\n"
"lekin kalit söz argumentlari barça pozitsion argumentlardan keyin kelişi kerak.\n"
"Pythonga köra, siz pozitsion argumentlarni kalit söz argumentlaridan keyin işlatgansiz.\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:1670 syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:1360
msgid ""
"I am guessing that you wanted to use an `except` statement\n"
"with multiple exception types. If that is the case, you must\n"
"surround them with parentheses.\n"
msgstr ""
"Taxminimça, siz bir neçta istisno turi bilan `except` operatoridan\n"
"foydalanmoqçi bölgansiz. Agar şunday bölsa, ularni\n"
"qavslar içiga olişingiz kerak.\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:1682
msgid ""
"In Python, you can call functions with only positional arguments\n"
"\n"
"    test(1, 2, 3)\n"
"\n"
"or only keyword arguments\n"
"\n"
"    test(a=1, b=2, c=3)\n"
"\n"
"or a combination of the two\n"
"\n"
"    test(1, 2, c=3)\n"
"\n"
"but with the keyword arguments appearing after all the positional ones.\n"
"According to Python, you used positional arguments after keyword ones.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pythonda funksiyalarni faqat pozitsion argumentlar bilan\n"
"\n"
"    test(1, 2, 3)\n"
"\n"
"yoki faqat kalit söz argumentlari bilan\n"
"\n"
"    test(a=1, b=2, c=3)\n"
"\n"
"yoki ikkalasining birikmasi bilan çaqiriş mumkin\n"
"\n"
"    test(1, 2, c=3)\n"
"\n"
"lekin kalit söz argumentlari barça pozitsion argumentlardan keyin kelişi kerak.\n"
"Pythonga köra, siz pozitsion argumentlarni kalit söz argumentlaridan keyin işlatgansiz.\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:1709 syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:686
msgid ""
"Perhaps you need to type\n"
"\n"
"     print({message})\n"
"\n"
"In older version of Python, `print` was a keyword.\n"
"Now, `print` is a function; you need to use parentheses to call it.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ehtimol, siz quyidagini yozişingiz kerak:\n"
"\n"
"     print({message})\n"
"\n"
"Pythonning eski versiyalarida `print` kalit söz edi.\n"
"Endi `print` — funksiya; uni çaqiriş uçun qavslardan foydalanişingiz kerak.\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:1716 syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:693
msgid "Note that arguments of `print` must be separated by commas.\n"
msgstr "Eʼtibor bering, `print` ning argumentlari vergul bilan ajratilişi kerak.\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:1717 syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:694
msgid "Did you mean `print({message})`?\n"
msgstr "`print({message})` ni nazarda tutdingizmi?\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:1726
msgid "You can only use a `return` statement inside a function or method.\n"
msgstr "`return` operatoridan faqat funksiya yoki metod içida foydalaniş mumkin.\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:1735
msgid ""
"A star assignment must be of the form:\n"
"\n"
"    ... *name = list_or_tuple\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Yulduzçali qiymat beriş quyidagi körinişda bölişi kerak:\n"
"\n"
"    ... *name = list_or_tuple\n"
"\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:1745
msgid ""
"It looks like you tried to use a starred expression as a dict value;\n"
"this is not allowed.\n"
msgstr ""
"Aftidan, siz yulduzçali ifodani luğat qiymati sifatida işlatişga urindingiz;\n"
"bunga ruxsat yöq.\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:1772
msgid ""
"Your code is too complex for Python:\n"
"you need to reduce the number of indented code blocks\n"
"contained inside other code blocks.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kodingiz Python uçun juda murakkab:\n"
"boşqa kod bloklari içidagi çekiniş bilan yozilgan\n"
"kod bloklari sonini kamaytirişingiz kerak.\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:1785
msgid ""
"Your code is too complex for Python:\n"
"you need to reduce the number of parentheses\n"
"contained inside other parentheses.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kodingiz Python uçun juda murakkab:\n"
"boşqa qavslar içidagi qavslar sonini\n"
"kamaytirişingiz kerak.\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:1800
msgid ""
"Python indicates that you need to surround an expression\n"
"ending with a comma by parentheses.\n"
msgstr ""
"Python vergul bilan tugaydigan ifodani qavslar içiga\n"
"olişingiz kerakligini körsatyapti.\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:1804
msgid ""
"I have no additional suggestion to offer.\n"
"Please feel free to report this case.\n"
msgstr ""
"Taklif qiladigan boşqa narsam yöq.\n"
"Iltimos, bu holat haqida bemalol xabar bering.\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:1814
msgid ""
"Perhaps you meant to write\n"
"\n"
"`{new_statement}`\n"
msgstr ""
"Ehtimol, siz quyidagini yozmoqçi bölgandirsiz:\n"
"\n"
"`{new_statement}`\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:1822
msgid "However, I suspect that you wrote the keyword `{boolean}` by mistake.\n"
msgstr "Biroq menimça, siz `{boolean}` kalit sözini xato yozib qöygansiz.\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:1826
msgid "The Python keyword `{boolean}` can only be used for boolean expressions.\n"
msgstr "Pythonning `{boolean}` kalit sözi faqat mantiqiy ifodalar uçun işlatilişi mumkin.\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:1838 syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:1851
msgid "However, if you remove the last comma, there will be no syntax error.\n"
msgstr "Biroq oxirgi vergulni olib taşlasangiz, sintaksis xatosi bölmaydi.\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:1866
msgid ""
"You are using the continuation character `\\` outside of a string,\n"
"and it is followed by some other character(s).\n"
msgstr ""
"Siz davom ettiriş belgisi `\\` ni satrdan taşqarida işlatyapsiz\n"
"va undan keyin boşqa belgi(lar) keladi.\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:1889
msgid ""
"I am guessing that you wanted to divide by the number {number} \n"
"and wrote \\ instead of /."
msgstr ""
"Taxminimça, siz {number} soniga bölmoqçi bölgansiz\n"
"va / örniga \\ yozgansiz."

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:1893
msgid "Did you mean to divide by {number}?\n"
msgstr "{number} ga bölmoqçi bölganmidingiz?\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:1896
msgid "I am guessing that you forgot to enclose some content in a string.\n"
msgstr "Taxminimça, siz baʼzi mazmunni satr içiga olişni unutgansiz.\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:1905
msgid ""
"Python tells us that it reached the end of the file\n"
"and expected more content.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Python fayl oxiriga yetganini va\n"
"yana mazmun kutganini aytyapti.\n"
"\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:1912
msgid ""
"I will attempt to be give a bit more information.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Biroz köproq maʼlumot berişga harakat qilaman.\n"
"\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:1923
msgid ""
"I suspect that you wrote a string that contains\n"
"one backslash character, `\\` followed by an uppercase `U`\n"
"and some more characters.\n"
"Python likely interpreted this as indicating the beginning of\n"
"what is known as an escape sequence for special unicode characters.\n"
"To solve the problem, either write a so-called 'raw string'\n"
"by adding the letter `r` as a prefix in\n"
"front of the string, or replace `\\U`, by `\\\\U`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Menimça, siz bitta teskari egri çiziq belgisi `\\`, undan keyin katta `U`\n"
"va yana bir neçta belgi bölgan satr yozgansiz.\n"
"Python, ehtimol, buni maxsus unicode belgilari uçun\n"
"ekranlaş ketma-ketligining (escape sequence) boşlanişi deb tuşungan.\n"
"Muammoni hal qiliş uçun satr oldiga `r` harfini qöşib,\n"
"\"xom satr\" (raw string) yozing yoki `\\U` ni `\\\\U` bilan almaştiring.\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:1947 syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:151
msgid "The closing {bracket} on line {linenumber} does not match anything.\n"
msgstr "{linenumber}-qatordagi yopuvçi {bracket} heç narsaga mos kelmaydi.\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:1958
msgid "Perhaps you forgot a closing quote.\n"
msgstr "Ehtimol, yopuvçi qöştirnoqni unutgandirsiz.\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:1971
msgid ""
"Inside the f-string `{fstring}`, \n"
"you have another string, which starts with either a\n"
"single quote (') or double quote (\"), without a matching closing one.\n"
msgstr ""
"`{fstring}` f-satri içida\n"
"yakka qöştirnoq (') yoki qöş qöştirnoq (\") bilan boşlanadigan,\n"
"lekin mos yopuvçi qöştirnoği bölmagan boşqa satr bor.\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:1984
msgid "You can only use a `yield` statement inside a function.\n"
msgstr "`yield` operatoridan faqat funksiya içida foydalaniş mumkin.\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:1993
msgid ""
"This is a message that was added in Python 3.9\n"
"to prevent redefining `__peg_parser__`.\n"
"It should not be present in other versions.\n"
msgstr ""
"Bu `__peg_parser__` ni qayta aniqlaşning oldini oliş uçun\n"
"Python 3.9 da qöşilgan xabar.\n"
"U boşqa versiyalarda bölmasligi kerak.\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:2055
msgid ""
"Friendly-traceback cannot identify the non-printable character.\n"
"This should not happen. Please report this case"
msgstr ""
"Friendly-traceback çop etilmaydigan belgini aniqlay olmaydi.\n"
"Bunday bölmasligi kerak edi. Iltimos, bu holat haqida xabar bering"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:2069 syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:107
msgid "Your code contains the invalid non-printable character {char}.\n"
msgstr "Kodingizda çop etilmaydigan notöğri belgi {char} bor.\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:2091 syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:360
msgid "Did you mean `from {module} import {function}`?\n"
msgstr "`from {module} import {function}` ni nazarda tutdingizmi?\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:2094 syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:363
msgid ""
"You wrote something like\n"
"\n"
"    import {function} from {module}\n"
"\n"
"instead of\n"
"\n"
"    from {module} import {function}\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Siz\n"
"\n"
"    from {module} import {function}\n"
"\n"
"örniga quyidagiga öxşaş narsa yozdingiz:\n"
"\n"
"    import {function} from {module}\n"
"\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:2113
msgid ""
"The statement `{line}` is not valid.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"`{line}` operatori notöğri.\n"
"\n"

#: syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:2117 syntax_errors\message_analyzer.py:2125
msgid "I don't have any additional information"
msgstr "Menda qöşimça maʼlumot yöq"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:129
msgid "Did you forget to add an index?\n"
msgstr "Indeks qöşişni unutdingizmi?\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:130
msgid ""
"It looks like you forgot to add an index.\n"
"Perhaps you meant to write something like:\n"
"\n"
"    {new_line}"
msgstr ""
"Aftidan, siz indeks qöşişni unutgansiz.\n"
"Ehtimol, quyidagiga öxşaş narsa yozmoqçi bölgandirsiz:\n"
"\n"
"    {new_line}"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:186
msgid "The closing {bracket} on line {close_lineno} does not match the opening {open_bracket} on line {open_lineno}.\n"
msgstr "{close_lineno}-qatordagi yopuvçi {bracket} {open_lineno}-qatordagi oçuvçi {open_bracket} ga mos kelmaydi.\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:208
msgid "Did you mean to write `...`?\n"
msgstr "`...` deb yozmoqçi bölganmidingiz?\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:209
msgid "It looks like you meant to write `...` but added an extra `.` by mistake.\n"
msgstr "Aftidan, siz `...` deb yozmoqçi bölgansiz, lekin tasodifan ortiqça `.` qöşib qöygansiz.\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:223
msgid ""
"It looks like you copy-pasted code from an interactive interpreter.\n"
"The Python prompt, `>>>`, should not be included in your code.\n"
msgstr ""
"Aftidan, siz kodni interaktiv interpretatordan nusxa olib joylaştirgansiz.\n"
"Python taklif belgisi `>>>` kodingizda bölmasligi kerak.\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:233
msgid ""
"It looks like you copy-pasted code from an interactive interpreter.\n"
"The Python prompt, `...`, should not be included in your code.\n"
msgstr ""
"Aftidan, siz kodni interaktiv interpretatordan nusxa olib joylaştirgansiz.\n"
"Python taklif belgisi `...` kodingizda bölmasligi kerak.\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:247
msgid "You should not use the backquote character.\n"
msgstr "Teskari qöştirnoq belgisidan foydalanmasligingiz kerak.\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:248
msgid ""
"You are using the backquote character.\n"
"Either you meant to write a single quote, ', or copied Python 2 code;\n"
"in this latter case, use the function `repr(x)`."
msgstr ""
"Siz teskari qöştirnoq belgisidan foydalanyapsiz.\n"
"Yo siz yakka qöştirnoq ' yozmoqçi bölgansiz, yo Python 2 kodini nusxalagansiz;\n"
"oxirgi holda `repr(x)` funksiyasidan foydalaning."

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:269
msgid "You forgot to add a condition.\n"
msgstr "Siz şart qöşişni unutdingiz.\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:271
msgid ""
"An `if` statement requires a condition:\n"
"\n"
"    if condition:\n"
"        ...\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"`if` operatori şartni talab qiladi:\n"
"\n"
"    if condition:\n"
"        ...\n"
"\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:277
msgid ""
"A `while` loop requires a condition:\n"
"\n"
"    while condition:\n"
"        ...\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"`while` sikli şartni talab qiladi:\n"
"\n"
"    while condition:\n"
"        ...\n"
"\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:283
msgid "A `for` loop requires at least 3 more terms.\n"
msgstr "`for` sikli kamida yana 3 ta qismni talab qiladi.\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:284
msgid ""
"A `for` loop is an iteration over a sequence:\n"
"\n"
"    for element in sequence:\n"
"        ...\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"`for` sikli — ketma-ketlik böyiça iteratsiya:\n"
"\n"
"    for element in sequence:\n"
"        ...\n"
"\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:290
msgid "A class needs a name.\n"
msgstr "Klassga nom kerak.\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:291
msgid ""
"A `class` statement requires a name:\n"
"\n"
"    class SomeName:\n"
"        ...\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"`class` operatori nomni talab qiladi:\n"
"\n"
"    class SomeName:\n"
"        ...\n"
"\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:308
msgid ""
"You cannot use the Python keyword `{word}` as an attribute.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Pythonning `{word}` kalit sözini atribut sifatida işlatib bölmaydi.\n"
"\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:314
msgid "`{word}` cannot be used as an attribute.\n"
msgstr "`{word}` ni atribut sifatida işlatib bölmaydi.\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:336
msgid "Perhaps you meant to write `elif`.\n"
msgstr "Ehtimol, siz `elif` deb yozmoqçi bölgandirsiz.\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:337
msgid ""
"You likely meant to use Python's `elif` keyword\n"
"but wrote `{name}` instead.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Ehtimol, siz Pythonning `elif` kalit sözidan foydalanmoqçi bölgansiz,\n"
"lekin uning örniga `{name}` deb yozgansiz.\n"
"\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:434
msgid "The augmented assignment operator is not allowed in Python version {version}.\n"
msgstr "Python {version} versiyasida kengaytirilgan qiymat beriş operatoriga ruxsat yöq.\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:437
msgid ""
"You appear to be using the operator `:=`, sometimes called\n"
"the walrus operator. This operator requires the use of\n"
"Python 3.8 or newer. You are using version {version}.\n"
msgstr ""
"Aftidan, siz baʼzan \"morj operatori\" (walrus operator) deb ataladigan `:=`\n"
"operatoridan foydalanyapsiz. Bu operator Python 3.8 yoki undan\n"
"yangi versiyani talab qiladi. Siz {version} versiyasidan foydalanyapsiz.\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:481
msgid "Did you write operators in an incorrect order?\n"
msgstr "Operatorlarni notöğri tartibda yozmadingizmi?\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:482
msgid ""
"It looks like you wrote two operators (`{first}` and `{second}`)\n"
"in the wrong order: `{wrong}` instead of `{correct}`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Aftidan, siz ikki operatorni (`{first}` va `{second}`)\n"
"notöğri tartibda yozgansiz: `{correct}` örniga `{wrong}`.\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:518
msgid ""
"You wrote three equal signs in a row which is allowed in some\n"
"programming languages, but not in Python. To check if two objects\n"
"are equal, use two equal signs, `==`; to see if two names represent\n"
"the exact same object, use the operator `is`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Siz ketma-ket uçta tenglik belgisini yozdingiz, bunga baʼzi\n"
"dasturlaş tillarida ruxsat bor, lekin Pythonda yöq. Ikki obyekt\n"
"tengligini tekşiriş uçun ikkita tenglik belgisi `==` dan foydalaning; ikki nom\n"
"aynan bitta obyektni ifodalaşini tekşiriş uçun `is` operatoridan foydalaning.\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:524
msgid "Did you mean to use `is` instead of `===`?\n"
msgstr "`===` örniga `is` dan foydalanmoqçi bölganmidingiz?\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:528
msgid ""
"You cannot have write the same operator, `{op}`, twice in a row.\n"
"Perhaps you wrote one of them by mistake\n"
"or forgot to write something between them.\n"
msgstr ""
"Bir xil `{op}` operatorini ketma-ket ikki marta yozib bölmaydi.\n"
"Ehtimol, ulardan birini xato yozgansiz\n"
"yoki ular orasiga biror narsa yozişni unutgansiz.\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:539
msgid ""
"You cannot have these two operators, `{first}` and `{second}`,\n"
"following each other.\n"
"It looks like you tried to use a starred expression as a dict value;\n"
"this is not allowed.\n"
msgstr ""
"`{first}` va `{second}` operatorlari\n"
"ketma-ket kela olmaydi.\n"
"Aftidan, siz yulduzçali ifodani luğat qiymati sifatida işlatişga urindingiz;\n"
"bunga ruxsat yöq.\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:556
msgid ""
"You cannot have these two operators, `{first}` and `{second}`,\n"
"following each other. Perhaps you wrote one of them by mistake\n"
"or forgot to write something between them.\n"
msgstr ""
"`{first}` va `{second}` operatorlari\n"
"ketma-ket kela olmaydi. Ehtimol, ulardan birini xato yozgansiz\n"
"yoki ular orasiga biror narsa yozişni unutgansiz.\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:563
msgid ""
"Or perhaps you included a space by mistake between the two operators\n"
"and meant to write `{oper}` as a single operator.\n"
msgstr ""
"Yoki, ehtimol, ikki operator orasiga tasodifan böşliq qöyib qöygansiz\n"
"va `{oper}` ni bitta operator sifatida yozmoqçi bölgansiz.\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:598
msgid "Did you mean to use `=`?\n"
msgstr "`=` dan foydalanmoqçi bölganmidingiz?\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:599
msgid ""
"You use the augmented assignment operator `:=` where\n"
"the normal assignment operator `=` was required.\n"
msgstr ""
"Siz oddiy qiymat beriş operatori `=` talab qilingan joyda\n"
"kengaytirilgan qiymat beriş operatori `:=` dan foydalanyapsiz.\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:645
msgid ""
"The following statement would not contain a syntax error:\n"
"\n"
"    {new_statement}"
msgstr ""
"Quyidagi operatorda sintaksis xatosi bölmaydi:\n"
"\n"
"    {new_statement}"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:651
msgid "Perhaps you needed `==` or `:=` instead of `=`.\n"
msgstr "Ehtimol, sizga `=` örniga `==` yoki `:=` kerak edi.\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:652
msgid ""
"You used an assignment operator `=`; perhaps you meant to use \n"
"an equality operator, `==`, or the walrus operator `:=`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Siz qiymat beriş operatori `=` dan foydalandingiz; ehtimol, tenglik operatori `==`\n"
"yoki morj operatori `:=` dan foydalanmoqçi bölgandirsiz.\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:710
msgid ""
"It looks as if you are attempting to use pip to install a module.\n"
"`pip` is a command that needs to run in a terminal,\n"
"not from a Python interpreter.\n"
msgstr ""
"Aftidan, siz modul örnatiş uçun pip dan foydalanmoqçisiz.\n"
"`pip` Python interpretatorida emas, terminalda\n"
"işga tuşirilişi kerak bölgan buyruq.\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:718
msgid "Pip cannot be used in a Python interpreter.\n"
msgstr "Pip dan Python interpretatorida foydalanib bölmaydi.\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:721
msgid ""
"I am guessing that you are attempting to use Python to run a program.\n"
"You must do so from a terminal and not from a Python interpreter.\n"
msgstr ""
"Taxminimça, siz dasturni işga tuşiriş uçun Pythondan foydalanmoqçisiz.\n"
"Buni Python interpretatoridan emas, terminaldan bajarişingiz kerak.\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:731
msgid "You cannot have a dot `.` followed by `{bracket}`.\n"
msgstr "Nuqta `.` dan keyin `{bracket}` kela olmaydi.\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:747
msgid "Perhaps you need to replace the dot by a comma.\n"
msgstr "Ehtimol, nuqtani vergul bilan almaştirişingiz kerak.\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:758
msgid "It looks like you are trying to raise an exception using Python 2 syntax.\n"
msgstr "Aftidan, siz Python 2 sintaksisi yordamida istisno yuzaga keltirişga urinyapsiz.\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:819
msgid "Did you forget a colon `:`?\n"
msgstr "Ikki nuqta `:` ni unutdingizmi?\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:823
msgid ""
"You wrote a `{for_while}` loop but\n"
"forgot to add a colon `:` at the end\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Siz `{for_while}` siklini yozdingiz, lekin\n"
"oxiriga ikki nuqta `:` qöyişni unutdingiz\n"
"\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:830
msgid ""
"You wrote a statement beginning with\n"
"`{name}` but forgot to add a colon `:` at the end.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Siz `{name}` bilan boşlanadigan operator yozdingiz,\n"
"lekin oxiriga ikki nuqta `:` qöyişni unutdingiz.\n"
"\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:854
msgid "You wrote a semicolon, `;`, where a comma was expected.\n"
msgstr "Siz vergul kutilgan joyda nuqtali vergul `;` yozdingiz.\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:874
msgid "You wrote semicolons, `;`, where commas were expected.\n"
msgstr "Siz vergullar kutilgan joyda nuqtali vergullar `;` yozdingiz.\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:875
msgid "Did you mean to write commas?\n"
msgstr "Vergullar yozmoqçi bölganmidingiz?\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:895
msgid "You wrote a semicolon, `;`, where a colon was expected.\n"
msgstr "Siz ikki nuqta kutilgan joyda nuqtali vergul `;` yozdingiz.\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:896
msgid "Did you mean to write a colon?\n"
msgstr "Ikki nuqta yozmoqçi bölganmidingiz?\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:914
msgid "Did you made a mistake in writing an hexadecimal integer?\n"
msgstr "Ön oltilik butun sonni yozişda xato qilmadingizmi?\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:915
msgid ""
"It looks like you used an invalid character (`{character}`) in an hexadecimal number.\n"
"\n"
"Hexadecimal numbers are base 16 integers that use the symbols `0` to `9`\n"
"to represent values 0 to 9, and the letters `a` to `f` (or `A` to `F`)\n"
"to represent values 10 to 15.\n"
"In Python, hexadecimal numbers start with either `0x` or `0X`,\n"
"followed by the characters used to represent the value of that integer.\n"
msgstr ""
"Aftidan, siz ön oltilik sonda notöğri belgi (`{character}`) işlatgansiz.\n"
"\n"
"Ön oltilik sonlar — 0 dan 9 gaça qiymatlarni ifodalaş uçun `0` dan `9` gaça belgilarni,\n"
"10 dan 15 gaça qiymatlarni ifodalaş uçun esa `a` dan `f` gaça (yoki `A` dan `F` gaça)\n"
"harflarni işlatadigan 16 asosli butun sonlar.\n"
"Pythonda ön oltilik sonlar `0x` yoki `0X` bilan boşlanadi,\n"
"undan keyin esa şu butun sonning qiymatini ifodalovçi belgilar keladi.\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:934
msgid "Did you made a mistake in writing an octal integer?\n"
msgstr "Sakkizlik butun sonni yozişda xato qilmadingizmi?\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:935
msgid ""
"It looks like you used an invalid character (`{character}`) in an octal number.\n"
"\n"
"Octal numbers are base 8 integers that only use the symbols `0` to `7`\n"
"to represent values.\n"
"In Python, octal numbers start with either `0o` or `0O`,\n"
"(the digit zero followed by the letter `o`)\n"
"followed by the characters used to represent the value of that integer.\n"
msgstr ""
"Aftidan, siz sakkizlik sonda notöğri belgi (`{character}`) işlatgansiz.\n"
"\n"
"Sakkizlik sonlar — qiymatlarni ifodalaş uçun faqat `0` dan `7` gaça belgilarni\n"
"işlatadigan 8 asosli butun sonlar.\n"
"Pythonda sakkizlik sonlar `0o` yoki `0O` bilan boşlanadi\n"
"(nol raqami va undan keyin `o` harfi),\n"
"undan keyin esa şu butun sonning qiymatini ifodalovçi belgilar keladi.\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:962
msgid "Valid names cannot begin with a number.\n"
msgstr "Töğri nomlar raqam bilan boşlana olmaydi.\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:969
msgid "Did you mean `{number}j`?\n"
msgstr "`{number}j` ni nazarda tutdingizmi?\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:970
msgid ""
"Perhaps you thought that `i` could be used to represent\n"
"the square root of `-1`. In Python, the symbol used for this is `j`\n"
"and the complex part is written as `some_number` immediately\n"
"followed by `j`, with no spaces in between.\n"
"Perhaps you meant to write `{number}j`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ehtimol, siz `-1` ning kvadrat ildizini ifodalaş uçun `i` dan\n"
"foydalaniş mumkin deb öylagandirsiz. Pythonda buning uçun `j` belgisi işlatiladi\n"
"va kompleks qism `some_number` va undan keyin darhol,\n"
"orada böşliqsiz `j` körinişida yoziladi.\n"
"Ehtimol, siz `{number}j` deb yozmoqçi bölgandirsiz.\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:980
msgid "Did you mean `{number}{second}0`?\n"
msgstr "`{number}{second}0` ni nazarda tutdingizmi?\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:983
msgid ""
"Perhaps you meant to write `{number}{second}0` in scientific notation\n"
"and forgot the numerical value for the exponent.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ehtimol, siz ilmiy yozuvda `{number}{second}0` deb yozmoqçi bölgansiz\n"
"va daraja körsatkiçining son qiymatini unutgansiz.\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:990
msgid ""
"[Note: `{first} * {second}` would also be valid\n"
"since `{first}` is a complex number.]\n"
msgstr ""
"[Izoh: `{first}` kompleks son bölgani uçun\n"
"`{first} * {second}` ham töğri bölardi.]\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:1001
msgid "Perhaps you forgot a multiplication operator, `{first} * {second}`.\n"
msgstr "Ehtimol, siz köpaytiriş operatorini unutgandirsiz: `{first} * {second}`.\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:1016
msgid "Your Python version does not support this f-string feature.\n"
msgstr "Python versiyangiz f-satrlarning bu imkoniyatini qöllab-quvvatlamaydi.\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:1017
msgid ""
"You are likely using a 'debug' syntax of f-strings introduced\n"
"in Python version 3.8. You are using version {version}.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ehtimol, siz Python 3.8 versiyasida kiritilgan f-satrlarning\n"
"\"debug\" sintaksisidan foydalanyapsiz. Siz {version} versiyasidan foydalanyapsiz.\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:1023
msgid ""
"You are likely trying to assign a value within an f-string.\n"
"This is not allowed.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ehtimol, siz f-satr içida qiymat berişga urinyapsiz.\n"
"Bunga ruxsat yöq.\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:1038
msgid ""
"The content of your f-string is invalid. Please consult the documentation:\n"
"https://docs.python.org/3/reference/lexical_analysis.html#f-strings\n"
msgstr ""
"f-satringiz mazmuni notöğri. Iltimos, hujjatlarga murojaat qiling:\n"
"https://docs.python.org/3/reference/lexical_analysis.html#f-strings\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:1048
msgid "Python keywords cannot be used as identifiers (variable names).\n"
msgstr "Python kalit sözlarini identifikator (özgaruvçi nomi) sifatida işlatib bölmaydi.\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:1072
msgid ""
"`lambda` does not allow parentheses around its arguments.\n"
"This was allowed in Python 2 but it not allowed in Python 3.\n"
msgstr ""
"`lambda` argumentlari atrofida qavslarga ruxsat bermaydi.\n"
"Bunga Python 2 da ruxsat bor edi, lekin Python 3 da ruxsat yöq.\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:1089
msgid ""
"You cannot have explicit tuples as arguments.\n"
"Assign any tuple to a parameter and unpack it\n"
"within the body of the function.\n"
msgstr ""
"Argumentlar sifatida aniq körsatilgan kortejlar bölişi mumkin emas.\n"
"Kortejni parametrga bering va uni\n"
"funksiya tanasi içida yoying.\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:1127
msgid "If you remove `{type_decl}`, you will have a valid Python statement.\n"
msgstr "Agar `{type_decl}` ni olib taşlasangiz, töğri Python operatori hosil böladi.\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:1131
msgid ""
"However, even if you remove `{type_decl}`, there would still be some\n"
"some syntax errors.\n"
msgstr ""
"Biroq `{type_decl}` ni olib taşlasangiz ham, baribir baʼzi\n"
"sintaksis xatolari qoladi.\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:1136
msgid "You do not need to declare variables in Python.\n"
msgstr "Pythonda özgaruvçilarni eʼlon qiliş şart emas.\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:1137
msgid ""
"It looks like you were trying to declare that `{var}` was\n"
"a variable using the word `{type_decl}`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Aftidan, siz `{type_decl}` sözi yordamida `{var}` ni\n"
"özgaruvçi deb eʼlon qilmoqçi bölgansiz.\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:1174
msgid ""
"I am guessing that you forgot a comma between two strings\n"
"when defining a dict.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Taxminimça, siz luğatni aniqlaşda ikki satr orasida\n"
"vergulni unutgansiz.\n"
"\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:1226
msgid "Did you forget to write `in`?\n"
msgstr "`in` ni yozişni unutdingizmi?\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:1227
msgid ""
"It looks as though you forgot to use the keyword `in`\n"
"as part of a `for` statement. Perhaps you meant:\n"
"\n"
"    {new_statement}\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Aftidan, siz `for` operatorining bir qismi sifatida `in` kalit sözini\n"
"işlatişni unutgansiz. Ehtimol, quyidagini nazarda tutgandirsiz:\n"
"\n"
"    {new_statement}\n"
"\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:1255
msgid "Did you forget to write parenthesis?\n"
msgstr "Qavslarni yozişni unutdingizmi?\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:1256
msgid ""
"It looks as though you forgot to use to use parenthesis with `range`.\n"
"Perhaps you meant:\n"
"\n"
"    {new_statement}\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Aftidan, siz `range` bilan qavslardan foydalanişni unutgansiz.\n"
"Ehtimol, quyidagini nazarda tutgandirsiz:\n"
"\n"
"    {new_statement}\n"
"\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:1288
msgid ""
"Perhaps you meant to write `{keyword}` and made a typo.\n"
"The correct line might be `{line}`\n"
msgstr ""
"Ehtimol, siz `{keyword}` deb yozmoqçi bölib, xato yozib qöygandirsiz.\n"
"Töğri qator `{line}` bölişi mumkin\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:1301
msgid ""
"I am guessing that you were writing a comprehension or a generator expression\n"
"and use the wrong order for a condition.\n"
"The correct order depends if there is an `else` clause or not.\n"
"For example, the correct order for a list comprehensions with\n"
"condition can be either\n"
"\n"
"    [f(x) if condition else other for x in sequence]  # 'if' before 'for'\n"
"\n"
"or, if there is no `else`\n"
"\n"
"    [f(x) for x in sequence if condition]  # 'if' after 'for'\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Taxminimça, siz röyxat ifodasi (comprehension) yoki generator ifodasini yozayotgan edingiz\n"
"va şart uçun notöğri tartibdan foydalandingiz.\n"
"Töğri tartib `else` qismi bor-yöqligiga bağliq.\n"
"Masalan, şartli röyxat ifodasi (list comprehension) uçun töğri tartib\n"
"quyidagilardan biri bölişi mumkin:\n"
"\n"
"    [f(x) if condition else other for x in sequence]  # 'if' 'for' dan oldin\n"
"\n"
"yoki, agar `else` bölmasa:\n"
"\n"
"    [f(x) for x in sequence if condition]  # 'if' 'for' dan keyin\n"
"\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:1413
msgid ""
"You cannot have spaces in identifiers (variable names).\n"
"Perhaps you meant `{name}`?\n"
msgstr ""
"Identifikatorlarda (özgaruvçi nomlarida) böşliqlar bölişi mumkin emas.\n"
"Ehtimol, `{name}` ni nazarda tutgandirsiz?\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:1435
msgid "`bf` is an illegal string prefix.\n"
msgstr "`bf` — ruxsat etilmagan satr prefiksi.\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:1436
msgid ""
"I am guessing that you wanted a binary f-string;\n"
"this is not allowed.\n"
msgstr ""
"Taxminimça, sizga ikkilik (binary) f-satr kerak edi;\n"
"bunga ruxsat yöq.\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:1460
msgid ""
"It is possible that you forgot a comma between items in a tuple, \n"
"or between function arguments, \n"
"at the position indicated by ^.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ehtimol, siz ^ bilan körsatilgan joyda kortej elementlari\n"
"yoki funksiya argumentlari orasida\n"
"vergulni unutgansiz.\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:1468
msgid ""
"It is possible that you forgot a comma between items in a list\n"
"at the position indicated by ^.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ehtimol, siz ^ bilan körsatilgan joyda röyxat elementlari orasida\n"
"vergulni unutgansiz.\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:1474
msgid ""
"It is possible that you forgot a comma between items in a set or dict\n"
"at the position indicated by ^.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ehtimol, siz ^ bilan körsatilgan joyda töplam (set) yoki luğat (dict) elementlari orasida\n"
"vergulni unutgansiz.\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:1504
msgid "Python indicates that the error is caused by `{second}` written immediately after `{first}`.\n"
msgstr "Python xatoga `{first}` dan keyin darhol yozilgan `{second}` sabab bölganini körsatyapti.\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:1561
msgid "Perhaps you meant{line}"
msgstr "Ehtimol, siz quyidagini nazarda tutgandirsiz{line}"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:1568
msgid "Did you forget something between `{first}` and `{second}`?\n"
msgstr "`{first}` va `{second}` orasida biror narsani unutdingizmi?\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:1583
msgid ""
"Perhaps you meant to insert an operator like `{operators}`\n"
"between `{first}` and `{second}`.\n"
"The following lines of code would not cause any `SyntaxError`:\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Ehtimol, siz `{first}` va `{second}` orasiga\n"
"`{operators}` kabi operator qöymoqçi bölgandirsiz.\n"
"Quyidagi kod qatorlari heç qanday `SyntaxError` ga olib kelmaydi:\n"
"\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:1592
msgid ""
"Note: these are just some of the possible choices and that\n"
"some of them might raise other types of exceptions.\n"
msgstr ""
"Izoh: bular mumkin bölgan variantlarning faqat bir qismi bölib,\n"
"ulardan baʼzilari boşqa turdagi istisnolarni yuzaga keltirişi mumkin.\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:1599
msgid "There is an additional possibility.\n"
msgstr "Yana bir imkoniyat bor.\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:1614
msgid ""
"It is possible that you used an equal sign `=` instead of a colon `:`\n"
"to assign values to keys in a dict\n"
"before or at the position indicated by ^.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ehtimol, siz ^ bilan körsatilgan joyda yoki undan oldin\n"
"luğatdagi kalitlarga qiymat beriş uçun\n"
"ikki nuqta `:` örniga tenglik belgisi `=` dan foydalangansiz.\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:1637
msgid ""
"The Python keyword `{boolean}` can only be used for boolean expressions.\n"
"Perhaps you meant to write\n"
"\n"
"`{new_statement}`\n"
msgstr ""
"Pythonning `{boolean}` kalit sözi faqat mantiqiy ifodalar uçun işlatilişi mumkin.\n"
"Ehtimol, siz quyidagini yozmoqçi bölgandirsiz:\n"
"\n"
"`{new_statement}`\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:1667
msgid ""
"I am guessing that you are trying to import at least one object\n"
"from module `{module}` and rename it using the Python keyword `as`;\n"
"this keyword can only be used to rename one object at a time\n"
"using a well defined syntax.\n"
"I suggest that you split up any such import statement with each object\n"
"renamed on a separate line as follows:\n"
"\n"
"    from {module} import object_1 as name_1\n"
"    from {module} import object_2 as name_2  # if needed\n"
msgstr ""
"Taxminimça, siz `{module}` modulidan kamida bitta obyektni import qilib,\n"
"uni Pythonning `as` kalit sözi yordamida qayta nomlamoqçi bölgansiz;\n"
"bu kalit söz aniq belgilangan sintaksis yordamida bir vaqtda\n"
"faqat bitta obyektni qayta nomlaş uçun işlatilişi mumkin.\n"
"Bunday import operatorini har bir obyekt alohida qatorda\n"
"qayta nomlanadigan qilib quyidagiça ajratişni taklif qilaman:\n"
"\n"
"    from {module} import object_1 as name_1\n"
"    from {module} import object_2 as name_2  # kerak bölsa\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:1697
msgid ""
"I am guessing that you wrote {bad_token} twice in a row by mistake.\n"
"If that is the case, you need to remove the second one.\n"
msgstr ""
"Taxminimça, siz {bad_token} ni tasodifan ketma-ket ikki marta yozgansiz.\n"
"Agar şunday bölsa, ikkinçisini olib taşlaşingiz kerak.\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:1701
msgid "Did you write {bad_token} twice by mistake?\n"
msgstr "{bad_token} ni tasodifan ikki marta yozmadingizmi?\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:1728
msgid ""
"I am guessing that you wrote {bad_token} by mistake.\n"
"Removing it and writing `{line}` seems to fix the error.\n"
msgstr ""
"Taxminimça, siz {bad_token} ni tasodifan yozgansiz.\n"
"Uni olib taşlab, `{line}` deb yoziş xatoni tuzatadiganga öxşaydi.\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:1732
msgid "Did you write {bad_token} by mistake?\n"
msgstr "{bad_token} ni tasodifan yozmadingizmi?\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:1749
msgid ""
"It looks like the error occurred as you were writing a Python dict.\n"
"Perhaps wrote a dict key without writing the corresponding value.\n"
msgstr ""
"Aftidan, xato Python luğatini (dict) yozayotganingizda yuz bergan.\n"
"Ehtimol, luğat kalitini unga mos qiymatsiz yozgandirsiz.\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:1765
msgid ""
"The `else` keyword does not begin a code block that matches\n"
"a valid code block, possibly because `else` is not indented correctly.\n"
msgstr ""
"`else` kalit sözi töğri kod blokiga mos keladigan kod blokini\n"
"boşlamaydi, ehtimol, `else` töğri çekiniş bilan yozilmagani uçun.\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:1777
msgid ""
"The `elif` keyword does not begin a code block that matches\n"
"an `if` block, possibly because `elif` is not indented correctly.\n"
msgstr ""
"`elif` kalit sözi `if` blokiga mos keladigan kod blokini\n"
"boşlamaydi, ehtimol, `elif` töğri çekiniş bilan yozilmagani uçun.\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:1790
msgid ""
"The `except` keyword does not begin a code block that matches\n"
"a `try` block, possibly because `except` is not indented correctly.\n"
msgstr ""
"`except` kalit sözi `try` blokiga mos keladigan kod blokini\n"
"boşlamaydi, ehtimol, `except` töğri çekiniş bilan yozilmagani uçun.\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:1803
msgid ""
"The `finally` keyword does not begin a code block that matches\n"
"a `try` block, possibly because `finally` is not indented correctly.\n"
msgstr ""
"`finally` kalit sözi `try` blokiga mos keladigan kod blokini\n"
"boşlamaydi, ehtimol, `finally` töğri çekiniş bilan yozilmagani uçun.\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:1842
msgid "You used square brackets, `[...]` instead of parentheses.\n"
msgstr "Siz qavslar örniga kvadrat qavslar `[...]` dan foydalandingiz.\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:1846
msgid ""
"Write the following instead:\n"
"\n"
"{new_statement}"
msgstr ""
"Buning örniga quyidagini yozing:\n"
"\n"
"{new_statement}"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:1890
msgid "The opening {bracket} on line {linenumber} is not closed.\n"
msgstr "{linenumber}-qatordagi oçuvçi {bracket} yopilmagan.\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:1904
msgid "If this is incorrect, please report this case.\n"
msgstr "Agar bu notöğri bölsa, iltimos, bu holat haqida xabar bering.\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:1916
msgid ""
"Perhaps you wrote a statement beginning a code block\n"
"intended to be part of a generator expression.\n"
"You cannot have separate code blocks inside generator expressions.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ehtimol, siz generator ifodasining bir qismi bölişi kerak bölgan\n"
"kod blokini boşlaydigan operator yozgansiz.\n"
"Generator ifodalari içida alohida kod bloklari bölişi mumkin emas.\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:1922
msgid ""
"Perhaps you wrote a statement beginning a code block\n"
"intended to be part of a list comprehension.\n"
"You cannot have separate code blocks inside list comprehensions.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ehtimol, siz röyxat ifodasining (list comprehension) bir qismi bölişi kerak bölgan\n"
"kod blokini boşlaydigan operator yozgansiz.\n"
"Röyxat ifodalari (list comprehension) içida alohida kod bloklari bölişi mumkin emas.\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:1928
msgid ""
"Perhaps you wrote a statement beginning a code block\n"
"intended to be part of a dict or set comprehension.\n"
"You cannot have separate code blocks inside dict or set comprehensions.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ehtimol, siz luğat yoki töplam ifodasining (comprehension) bir qismi bölişi kerak bölgan\n"
"kod blokini boşlaydigan operator yozgansiz.\n"
"Luğat yoki töplam ifodalari (comprehension) içida alohida kod bloklari bölişi mumkin emas.\n"

#: syntax_errors\statement_analyzer.py:1934
msgid "If this explanation is incorrect, please report this case.\n"
msgstr "Agar bu tuşuntiriş notöğri bölsa, iltimos, bu holat haqida xabar bering.\n"

